  ('zcrm_1579374000012409003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012724403', 'Fletcher Otwell', NULL, '01-10-18  Spoke to Fletcher &amp; wife this morning and presented our program.  Took him to our website and sent him 1st approach letter,  PHCS find a doc and HSA Bank info.  Will follow-up with him about enrolling.  He noted that he had a diagnosed with a childhood heart value issue but takes no meds, has check-ups resulting in no issues.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-01-10 08:39:05', '2018-01-10 08:39:05'),
