  ('zcrm_1579374000012385019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012416052', 'Emily Mellinger', NULL, '1-9-18 They had looked at LHS and Freedom Life. She is a member of Freedom Life but Lucas was rejected because he has a hearing aid which is ridiculous. Didn''t love LHS bc of religious roots. They are part of Appleton Clinics DPC who referred her. Both super healthy. Lucas just takes meds for dry skin bc of his work environment. Had an HSA previously but drained account. So, open to setting one up again if allowed. I told her it might not be possible bc of DPC. She''s fine either way. She''s enrolling now for Feb. 1st, 2018 for them as a couple so they can be on the same plan. $485/$1000. Done! All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-01-09 13:39:27', '2018-01-09 13:53:02'),
