  ('zcrm_1579374000012375009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011307064', 'Thomas White-O''Connor', NULL, '11-14-17 He and wife both have plaque build up on heart. Both got doctor''s to approve they don''t have any pre-x conditions so moved forward with HEP.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-01-08 22:28:30', '2018-01-08 22:28:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000012375003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012374010', 'Debbie Drobka', NULL, '11-13-17 Debbie is 53 and child is 19. Husband on Cobra for hip replacement. Maybe wants Dec. 1st start date. Likes to go to holistic docs and chiro. No meds, no tobacco, no drugs, knows this is not ins. Just got hired by Costco and might get ins. through them with great rate in possibly 90 days.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-01-08 22:10:52', '2018-01-08 22:10:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000012364095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881351', 'Ronald Stear', NULL, '12-15-17 Karl Adam is their accountant and he shared the info with them and they are ready to enroll. Emailing instructions right now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-01-08 17:07:40', '2018-01-08 17:07:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000012364089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537054', 'Michael Sharpe', NULL, '1-8-18 Mike is opting back in to receive emails according to his Financial Advisor Tyson VanLandingham. I will await his email to proceed requesting the information be sent to him again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-01-08 17:03:33', '2018-01-08 17:03:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000012364083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012416027', 'Judson Rogers', NULL, '1-8-17 He just checked with me about a collapsed lung he had 10 years ago. He had a follow up chest x-ray last year to check on it. I told him if was truly a checkup and no treatment recommended then it''s not pre-x. If treatment was recommended then yes on pre-x. He feels comfortable with it. Lindsay is on Zoloft and daughter just has viral asthma in winter and sometimes needs inhaler. Judd''s going to have their 2 yr old son do their wellness visit in Jan. to get that out of the way since he needs some immunizations and such. They''re going to do the $500 IUA and wants to fund HSA up to $2500 to cover smaller needs for family.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-01-08 16:17:17', '2018-01-08 16:17:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000012364077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474377', 'Lynette (Lynn) Arena', NULL, '1-8-18 She was diagnosed or misdiagnosed with Sarcoidosis over 3 years ago. Never been treated for, nothing to do. Only visited rheumatologist 1 year ago and levels were off but again no treatment recommended. Instead she likes holistic methods best and feels healthy and great. She''s paying $1500 a month now for family. But, going to put son on Medicaid, daughter on school program and husband on something else. This would be just for her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-01-08 14:49:51', '2018-01-08 14:49:51'),
