  ('zcrm_1579374000012325027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351173', 'Marsha Huber', NULL, '1-5-17 We just completed her application and she''s very happy to be done with it! Very appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-01-05 17:07:29', '2018-01-05 17:07:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000012325021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594156', 'Arthur Schwadron', NULL, '1-5-17 Art had just a few more questions understanding the terminology "sharing" making sure his monthly amount isn''t liable to change if money coming in isn''t enough for the money going out. Told him the history thus far. He''s planning to apply on Sunday and feels he''s capable of doing so on his own. Will wait for approval before cancel Kaiser which went from $960 to $1330 and feels being raked over the coals for that. He''s getting divorced and has court date set for April and son Noah just graduated from school a week ago. He''s 23 and still a dependent until he gets a job. Art is excited to strip it down to the $249 a month once he''s no longer supporting rest of the family. Wife might be on anti-depressant, not sure. He''s using Viagra on occasion. Otherwise they are all fairly healthy as far as he knows. Told him mental health is not included. He will let me know when he''s applied.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-01-05 16:00:55', '2018-01-05 16:00:55'),
