  ('zcrm_1579374000012325009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012379061', 'Lindsay Patterson', NULL, '1-5-18 Choosing to switch from HES to HEP $1000/$638 with new baby. Likes the tax benefits and no caps on wellness etc. Super healthy, no pre-x. Applying now. Will need to $100 to be waived since transferring. She was actually quite satisfied with LHS as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-01-05 12:14:33', '2018-01-05 12:14:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000012325003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630057', 'Kathleen Campbell', NULL, '1-5-18 Super healthy, no meds, nothing. Came via her twin sister Kate Richardson via Dr. Hercelroath. They''ve been using Aliera and it was horrible. She''s been fighting to get her annual wellness visit covered bc they had a 9 month waiting period that nobody informed her about and she can''t find it written anywhere. She''s had to fight to get her $1200 labs covered and then still had to pay for the $240 Dr. visit. She''s not pleased. She''s going to see how soon she can get out of Aliera and move to HEP. She thinks she pays an entire month in advance. She will also become part of Dr. H''s DPC. Told her the discounts are tentative but I should know very soon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-01-05 11:06:32', '2018-01-05 11:06:32'),
