  ('zcrm_1579374000011855163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899490', 'Savannah Jones', NULL, '12-14-17 Super nice. Wife is 28 and might join on her own or with newborn baby. They would have to pay $800 for the 3 of them on his work ins. But, for just him it''s $40 a month. With baby and him it''s $300 mo. Or put baby with her which might be cheapest and best option. He is over 30. All healthy and no pre-x.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-20 17:14:07', '2017-12-20 17:14:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011855157', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899452', 'Kristopher Hall', NULL, '12-19-17 Completed missing portion on app. Should be set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-20 17:07:24', '2017-12-20 17:07:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011855153', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899452', 'Kristopher Hall', NULL, '12-18-17  I helped Kris Hall and Sarah Nolan enroll today. I told them to put Jolie Curneen down as referring member. I see above it shows Keller Williams. Hmmm.. might have been from presentation I did last year. They are 28 and 30 so they put Kris who is 28 as primary member to see if they get the discounted rate. Not sure. We will see. He''s fine either way. They may call Patti to change checking account information. All set otherwise. I sent them link for dental discount plans.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-20 17:06:57', '2017-12-20 17:07:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011855149', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899452', 'Kristopher Hall', NULL, '12-4-17 Healthy, Kris is 28 and Sarah is 30. Both have heart murmurs, not a concern. Kris is quitting job soon and likely needs ins. to begin Jan. 1st. But, he''s going to double check when it would end. Sent them application to complete on their own and follow up appt in case they run into trouble. They want dental and vision discount plans as well!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-20 17:06:43', '2017-12-20 17:06:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011855145', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919812', 'Mary Beth Hassett', NULL, 'Completed application after 4 tries! Had problems all the way through. I think her internet connection was bad bc it kept stalling out on her end. It''s done now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-20 17:05:42', '2017-12-20 17:05:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011855141', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857102', 'Kimi Mischke', NULL, 'Add a note11-14-17 Completed enrollment just now. Chose the $786/$500 level. Did have a twisted colon surgery this year and husband had appendectomy. I think that''s what she said. I might have it backwards. She''s all set to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-20 16:55:51', '2017-12-20 16:55:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011855137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857102', 'Kimi Mischke', NULL, '11-9-17 Only issue is Kimi has chronic depression dealt with by meds 3. Bupropion HCS ER, $21.77, Venlafaxine ER around $25, Evermist $125. Kimi is 49. Paying $2600 a month with Anthem! Is already paying oop for psychiatrist visits 2x year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-20 16:55:34', '2017-12-20 16:55:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011855127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006366071', 'Michael Johnson', NULL, '12-20-17 Plans to enroll tomorrow bc won''t be home until 10:00 tonight.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-20 16:16:49', '2017-12-20 16:16:49'),
