  ('zcrm_1579374000011894063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919812', 'Mary Beth Hassett', 'ZOHO SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 225 
Question : filling out the application, hit the save button and wheel keeps turning, how long does this take? I do not want to fill this out for the third time, I worked on it yesterday and am trying to complete it now, thank you', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2017-12-20 13:18:56', '2017-12-20 13:18:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011855111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919064', 'Steve Godber', NULL, '12-20-17 Came to me through his brother Larry Godber. Larry said he found us from Googling. But, Steve said he spoke with Dr. Ethan originally. So, I need to tell Jane! Steve is enrolling now after I explained it all to him. He''s choosing the $1000/$249 IUA. Healthy, no meds, no smoking, etc. 60.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-20 12:18:58', '2017-12-20 12:18:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011855107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012657055', 'Michelle Kinkead', NULL, '12-20-17 She is Carol Bank''s friend! Michelle has a complex scenario. Can get APTC of $384 mo and cheapest Bronze plan around $65 month for backup. Was thinking of doing LHS with Cloud. Might still do that. Also introduced HEP as an option. BUT, had surgery for uterine fibroids, had skin check and needs MOHS for basal cell spot on head. But, Dr. recommended to couldn''t do surgery until 1 yr out. So, hasn''t done it yet. Also had irregular mammogram that needs to be retested further. Can choose Anthem for $220 or Cigna for $198. Might also still want Cloud for smaller items. She might want to do Cloud with Cigna but I didn''t say that. But, might make most sense to protect her. Once all set then can do HEP later. She''ll let me know. She might get catastrophic for now and wait until Jan. to proceed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-20 11:48:29', '2018-01-19 15:27:00'),
