  ('zcrm_1579374000011728003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919089', 'Nancy Hoglund', NULL, '12-13-17  Took an inbound call from Nancy.  She found us by searing the internet.  The gym she goes to has Sedera for their group plan.  She ask the owner how to contact Sedera.  Sedera sent her to us today.  I ask how she found us and she did acknowledge that Thomas did say hello to her but at that time she was just investigating.  
Today I spent  1.25 hours with her taking her to our website and answering numerous questions.  She wants to enroll and we are connecting on 12-15 to do so.  I ask Patti how these should be handled and she felt whom ever does all the work and enrolls the person should get the commission.  We agreed that the Lead Owner and Producer should be changed once enrollment takes place and not make duplicate records.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2017-12-13 08:13:17', '2017-12-13 08:13:17'),
