  ('zcrm_1579374000011660110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083120', 'Margaret Noonan', 'ZOHO SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 178 
Question : Hi what link do I use to change my recurring bank acct info? Thank youo', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2017-12-13 04:43:55', '2017-12-13 04:43:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011683094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001637159', 'Gretchen Wegner', NULL, '12-12-17 Nervous about the religious aspect of LHS. Explained Health Excellence Plus to her and she''s going to look it all over. Check for her doctors and those were in network. Take Imitrex/Sumatriptan foro migraines and only costs about $16-$17. Had cyst removed on ovary. Also prefers naturopathic solutions such as chiropractor. Wants to look at Covered CA options as well. Might email them to me to compare tonight. Started making more money and will have to pay some back to gov. when files taxes. She''s weighing her options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-12 17:56:31', '2017-12-12 17:56:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011683084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740129', 'Julia (Wieck) Hardy', NULL, '12-12-17 Enrolled with me on the phone.  Included Dunbar. Chose $1000/$485 and healthy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-12 16:44:45', '2017-12-12 16:44:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011683079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610603', 'Robert Morey', NULL, '12-12-17 Enrolled and all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-12 15:35:16', '2017-12-12 15:35:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011683074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, '12-12-17 She is 56 and has 21 yr. old son. Been With Kaiser for 10 years and tired of them. Rates going from $464 to $638 this year. Has bicuspid heart valve and just needs diagnostic echo cardiogram very few years for a check up. She has not has symptoms or treatment of any kind in the last 36 months. She''s normal ht and wt. She may add her son since his plan was going from $150 or so to $293 as  a 21 year old!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-12 15:26:38', '2017-12-12 15:26:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011699003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659896', 'Cynthia Andresen', NULL, '12/12/17 JR Cindy called to say they were signing up today', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-12-12 15:10:55', '2017-12-12 15:10:55'),
