  ('zcrm_1579374000011694003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881333', 'Kaleb Kurz', NULL, '12/12  spoke with Kaleb about Medical Cost Sharing', 'Thomas Berghammer', 'Thomas Berghammer', '2017-12-12 14:14:33', '2017-12-12 14:14:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011683069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659990', 'Melissa Parenti', NULL, '12-12-17 Sister of Anne Singleton. Just completed app with me. She has 7 mo. old daughter. Dr. Chen-Becker was not in network but she understands she can still go and may have to may small difference in reimbursement rate. Other plans were going to cost her $659-$900 for terrible plans. Husband on work ins. Had gall stones that passed and UTI. Has ADD and gets Concerta. Shows for $114 and up on Goodrx.com Better than $250 she was paying w/o ins at one point. But paying $10 now with current ins. Chose the $500/$520 option.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-12 13:57:41', '2017-12-12 13:57:41'),
