  ('zcrm_1579374000011683036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716932', 'LouLou Piscatore', NULL, '12-12-17 Super skeptical but really wants to believe in it since regular ins. is so bad. She''s healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no surgeries. 48 lives in Manhattan, NY. Feels uncertain that hospital will allow her in without ins card. But, has decided to take the risk. Completed application with me on phone. Sounds happy now!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-12 11:40:57', '2017-12-12 12:05:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011683031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752297', 'Charles Johnson', NULL, '12-12-17  Charles ask for pricing on dental mouthwash.  He did not provide me with product name.  Attempting to engage with him to provide that information.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2017-12-12 11:39:03', '2017-12-12 11:39:03'),
