  ('zcrm_1579374000011683003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919419', 'Leo Goodman', NULL, '12-12-17 Interesting character.  Actor and has day job that he has ins through right now. But, wants to act full time if possible soon. Paying $300 through work and they are paying $300. If goes on wife''s plan it would cost $600. If chooses cheapest Marketplace plan it would cost $430. He was pre-diabetic few a years ago but no longer. Has acid reflux. Dislocated shoulder but more than 3 years ago. Wants to read over it but is very interested.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-12 09:56:41', '2017-12-12 09:56:41'),
