  ('zcrm_1579374000011625092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716785', 'Megan Friday', NULL, '12-11-17 Completed app today on own!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-11 18:49:32', '2017-12-11 18:49:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011625087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716761', 'Bruce Talley', NULL, '12-11-17 Bruce and Laura or Lauren were super nice! They''ve been with Kaiser for over 20+ years and did a ton of research before our call. So, only had a few questions. Bruce had read all of the Guidelines. He''s retired at 59 and has been retired for 10 years! Live in Louisville. Bruce will follow my enrollment instructions to complete application. He wants to talk with one other couple who was interested in this tonight and then hopefully move forward. He will also let Cindy know that they are not responsible for the 6th incident if that were to happen, that it''s shared 100% for 6+ or 4+ per indiv.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-11 17:23:18', '2017-12-11 17:23:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011625071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011624140', 'Nick Gould', NULL, '12-11-17 "Hi Wendy
Thank you for taking the time to chat with about insurance.  At this time we have moved in another direction.  And that is not to say we could change plans come next year.
Thank you,
Nick', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-11 16:40:24', '2017-12-11 16:40:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011625066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939131', 'Laura Clemmons', NULL, '12-11-17 Family of 4. Healthy, clinical herbalist, Italian and makes all own food. Was on Medicaid for a few year but husband got job in Oct and no longer qualify. Excited about this and I sent her application to proceed. She''ll email me when complete.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-11 16:24:02', '2017-12-11 16:24:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011625061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659388', 'Jeremy VanSickle', NULL, '12-11-17 Wife just has mild high blood pressure and no meds and mild thyroid issue and no meds. He''s healthy and they want to sign up. Had a bad experience with Kaiser last year with a bite in Costa Rica that wound up costing them thousands of dollars bc they forced her into level 5 triage or something crazy and it was 3 weeks after the bite. They wound up doing self pay after that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-11 16:02:01', '2017-12-11 16:02:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011625056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899416', 'Talia Tiram', NULL, '12-11-17 Individual, interested, had read about LHS but read pregnancy would cost $3000, hmmmm..., She''s super interested in HEP and I sent her the information. She will read it and let me know if/when she''s ready to sign up. Lives in Boulder.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-11 15:45:16', '2017-12-11 15:45:16'),
