  ('zcrm_1579374000011625028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716785', 'Megan Friday', NULL, '12-11-17 Family of 4 in E. Boulder. Son has childhood asthma, very mild, may not have been symptomatic or treated in last 36 months. Not even sure if he still has an inhaler. Have an accident rider for $55 a month that covered the entire broken arm for daughter which was great but might not need it with HEP now. Ready to sign up hopefully today if she finds the time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-12-11 11:48:21', '2017-12-11 11:48:21'),
