  ('zcrm_1579374000011529013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004808011', 'Bradford Weeks', NULL, 'Greetings Patty,

As a follow-up to our phone conversation this morning, please cancel my membership in Health Excellence at the end of December 2017 which is the period that I have just paid for with your December billing. This membership includes Laura Weeks (me), Bradford Weeks and Amelia Weeks.

