  ('zcrm_1579374000011247051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012223122', 'Elizabeth Daly', NULL, 'We''ll see who see puts as the referring member. She''s thinking of using HEP with Cloud Medical. Was originally thinking of using LHS with Cloud but prefers my expertise. She is currently using Freedom Life and kids have chronic lyme disease. So, will keep them on their own plan. Likes Dr. Naler in Denver but loves PA Sherri Fox. Also taking son 18 to Hansa Center in Kansas to help treat lyme. We scheduled a follow up apt for Dec. 11th 9:00 am.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-29 17:02:19', '2017-11-29 17:02:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011247046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610284', 'Donna Ericson', NULL, '11-29-17 Husband on medicare now and she''s 62.5 now. Has Bright Health now and is paying $550 and going up to $750 in 2018 for Bronze HSA plan. She''s going to ask accountant if can benefit from HSA account since not earning income bc retired. Also going to see what doctor records show if thyroid has an symptoms or treatment in last 36 months. She only does checkups every year and hasn''t has any problem in very long time and no meds. Should be fine but wants to check. Also has asthma that''s been dormant for last 10 years. She''s seeing Dr. on Dec. 12th and will call to ask if anything in records. Likely will want a Jan. 1st start date if clear on pre-x.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-29 16:25:51', '2017-11-29 16:25:51'),
