  ('zcrm_1579374000011247041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899508', 'Kyle Gustafson', NULL, '11-29-17 He''s transitioning from Amazon to be on his own. Cobra will be $1000 mo for family of 5. Had a Global Health Plan bc lived in Luxembourg previously. Will stay on Cobra for month or two while doing PT for back injury that he had a surgery on. Wife takes meds for depression. Otherwise, all healthy. He will try to do application on own and will commit to reading instructions. He''s going to find out the cost of PT first to see if he can have a Jan. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-29 15:39:24', '2017-11-29 15:39:24'),
