  ('zcrm_1579374000011247023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521660', 'Teresa Robertson', NULL, '11-29-17 Is applying today! Already started and just asked me a few more questions to proceed. She''s super excited about it and is referring some folks through a friend of hers.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-29 12:17:10', '2017-11-29 12:17:10'),
