  ('zcrm_1579374000011179096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521058', 'Alejandra (Ale) Alduante', NULL, '11-28-17 Ale pronounced Ali! Super sweet! Lives in Vail Valley/Eagle County. Super healthy, see naturopath, yoga, no meds, no tobacco, no drugs. Main concern is for accidents on bike or some such thing. She also has an accident policy. Anthem was going to cost her $600 a year. Has an HSA account already. Gretchen is her best friend and her accountant. Super excited about this bc of naturopath, integrative, alternative options! She is Chilean. She wants to refer her employees at some point who also can''t afford healthcare. Some of them don''t speak English well so she was inquiring about possible help for them. Yes! Just completed enrollment now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-28 17:49:57', '2017-11-28 18:07:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011200096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191481', 'Kim Cahuas', NULL, '11-28-2017  I (Ron Patterson) spoke to Jeff and explained Kim Cahuas is my ex-wife and I speak to her on a weekly basis.  I advised her that her Liberty Health Share may not be in her best interest (especially due to the preventive cost restriction).  She wants to switch to Sedera and I ask Jeff if I can take over her membership which he agree for me to change the producer to me.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2017-11-28 17:06:45', '2017-11-28 17:06:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011179086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659096', 'Ann Renee Hassle', NULL, '11-28-17 Renee had a meniscus tear in Aug. 2017 and is healed now. She takes a sleep aid and depression meds zolpidem which is less than $10 a month. No smoking, tobacco, drugs. Wants to do preventative and knows value of HSA. She''s going to look over records from last 3 years to make sure she doesn''t have any other pre-x conditions to be concerned about. We have a follow up meeting on Dec. 7th to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-28 15:35:22', '2017-11-28 15:35:22'),
