  ('zcrm_1579374000011179081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005995075', 'Daniel Yechout', NULL, '11-28-17 They are thinking of keeping Anthem for Jan. bc Dan''s skin melanoma was treated in Jan. of 2015. He''s going to check his records to make sure. Then they can move to HEP, keep their HSA and be worry free for the cancer. They were mostly frustrated by Anthem bc didn''t include Children''s hospital and they''ve paid everything out of pocket. They never hit their deductible. Dan will contact me when they''ve discussed it and will likely move forward. He''ll email me when they are ready for the next steps.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-28 12:29:19', '2017-11-28 12:29:19'),
