  ('zcrm_1579374000011179023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521486', 'Ryan Ashley', NULL, 'Pastor at Church and wants to set up through church. Only his family right now but may share it with an employee or 2. All employees are only part time now. So, will set them up as individuals. Now isn''t sure if they need Nextera or not. I did not want to discourage it since Kyra sent them to me. Already has an HSA account. Was paying $950 last year for family and now going up to $1460 with Kaiser Bronze HSA plan. Healthy, no smoking, no drugs. Already looked at LHS and all others. Likes the HSA part the best since already has one.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-27 12:03:23', '2017-11-27 12:03:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011179018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005273011', 'Tina Le', NULL, '11-27-17 She was asking why HEP/Sedera is better than LHS bc husband was trying to get her to switch back to LHS. But, she''s the one experiencing the challenges of getting reimbursed in a timely fashion. Likes the HSA and prefers the convenience of self-pay and the ins. piece for wellness. So, she''ll stay put.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-27 10:54:50', '2017-11-27 10:54:50'),
