  ('zcrm_1579374000011053013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535018', 'Rodney Brandenburg', NULL, '11-21-17 Owns pawn shop in Longmont and 3500-4000 people come in each week. He''s happy to promote this in his shop with any promo materials I want to provide. He has 2 older kids, 23 and 25 who both file own taxes and are not in school. I think they have to be on their own but they are only earning $5K a year... They would qualify for Medicaid. They are non-smoking, healthy and using Freedom Life in TX now paying $900 a month for a terrible plan. He''s super excited about this!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-22 00:54:27', '2017-11-22 00:54:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011053008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716851', 'Amanda Simone', NULL, '11-21-17 33, Boulder, divorced, uninsured and self-employed. Healthy, no meds, chiropractor. Came via a FB post by Katherine Holt and Birchann chimed in as well. She''s paying between $300-$400 a month. She wants the $1000/$249 option and a Jan 1st start date. Also wants dental ins. and might need another root canal this year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-22 00:47:20', '2017-11-22 00:47:20'),
