  ('zcrm_1579374000011005054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521440', 'Jonathan Keith', NULL, '11-20-17 Looks for Jan. 1st start but will schedule with me week after Thanksgiving. Paying $298 with Anthem and high ded HSA plan. Likes the tax savings. Lives in Santa Barbara, 93108. Runs business with brother and dad but dad is on Medicare. Learned of this through a friend from church who is a CFO and has his company on Sedera''s plan. Healthy, no meds. He''s 37 and brother 39.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-20 17:28:36', '2017-11-20 17:28:36'),
