  ('zcrm_1579374000011005023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083032', 'Sorel Haruf', NULL, '11-20-17 Has no ins. now and was kicked off of Medicaid. Her dad passed away and now getting royalties from a movie he made with Robert Redford and other big names. Movie Our Souls at Night on Netflix. Healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco. Expecting to earn $37500 from Helen and Tara High School plus royalties from book bringing it up to about $57,500 for 2018 as best guess. Breaking point for APTC is $48,500.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-20 15:43:47', '2017-11-20 15:43:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000011005018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447407', 'Elizabeth Friedlander', NULL, 'Healthy, no problems. Doing her annual physical early Dec. Wants a Jan. 1st start date. Send her email to schedule appt. for 1st week in Dec. She was in the Rally Sport Yoga Class taught by Karuna with Amy, Johnny and I! I knew I''d seen her and couldn''t place her. Small world.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-20 15:22:03', '2017-11-20 15:22:03'),
