  ('zcrm_1579374000010881028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990490', 'Megan Clark', NULL, '11-14-17 Doctor did not give them the cost yet but she knows they need to do surgery whether or not they have to pay for it. It will be pre-x as far as I can see. But, Sedera can still help negotiate those rates down if need be. Dr. is calling her now...Apparently cost is going to be over $9438 for the surgery. She knows that up front. Dec. 1st start date. Current coverage covers nothing. Made it half way thorugh Sedera''s enrollment portion and system locked up. It bumped her out and may not have saved her information. She''ll finish it later.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-14 14:17:58', '2017-11-14 14:39:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010881023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848025', 'Jennika Wildau', NULL, '11-14-17 She''s on board for HEP/Sedera once I explain it all again. She will want to compare with trad ins. cost which I can do in advance of our meeting on Friday at 9:00. She''s happy Not to deal with C4HCO and is earning about $60K per year which is just likely over APTC level. Wants this for her and son. She''s an acupuncturist also.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-14 13:51:15', '2017-11-14 13:51:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010881018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497031', 'David Harap', NULL, '11-14-17 Super nice and easy to work with. Completed app in 1st phone appt. Only had hernia surgery 18 months ago and well managed high blood pressure and sleep apnea, the later two which are exempt from the pre-x clause. Lives in Austin, TX and is friends with Jamie LaGarde.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-14 13:42:25', '2017-11-14 13:42:25'),
