  ('zcrm_1579374000010881003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899089', 'Mateusz (Mat) Piasta', NULL, '11-14-17 His DPC Dr. Korba referred him. He''s Canadian citizen but lives here much of the year. He has a bunch of Independent Contract workers he can refer and he will refer the ones earning enough and healthy. He was paying $440 and now going up to $600. He''s 32 and healthy, plays soccer, snowboards, etc. He is hypothyroid but meds super cheap. Wants a Dec. 1st start and knows the deadlines and can fill out app on his own and will let me know when it''s done.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-14 12:00:51', '2017-11-14 12:00:51'),
