  ('zcrm_1579374000010876008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508208', 'Donna DeFede', NULL, 'Patti B. just alerted me that Donna enrolled on the HES side of the enrollment platform and she enter a start date of 12-20-17.  I called her and she wants a 1-1-18 start date.  She was also having a problem getting back into the Sedera website to enroll.   Patti gave her Sedera''s customer service number to get the problem fixed.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2017-11-14 09:55:09', '2017-11-28 21:03:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010876003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508208', 'Donna DeFede', NULL, 'Spoke to Donna today and answered a few questions she had.  She has visited our website.  I answer her questions and sent her the 1st introduction letter.  She wants to look over everything and ask me to follow-up with her tomorrow.  Email was sent.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2017-11-14 09:52:47', '2017-11-28 21:03:28'),
