  ('zcrm_1579374000010759058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537076', 'Maria (Chris) Comfort', NULL, '11-10-17 She is working with a trainer and nutritionist because over 100lbs overweight, high blood pressure but managed with meds. ADD and depression managed with meds. Recognizes that is all paid on her own. She wants a Jan. 1st start date. Price going up to $650-$900 this 2018. She had tears in her eyes she said when I told her the cost! Huge relief. I''ll email her info to read. 58 years old.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-10 17:54:11', '2017-11-10 17:55:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010759048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083120', 'Margaret Noonan', NULL, '11-10-17 Name pronounced with a hard G like gi in aikido.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-10 16:23:57', '2017-11-10 16:23:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010759043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083120', 'Margaret Noonan', NULL, '2018 in VA is going to cost $3500 a month for couple!!!!  They are healthy and found Sedera by google search. Researching Medishare but likes Sedera the best so far but was thrown for a loop when she learned she had to now go through MPB. Cool with it. Just needs to talk it over with husband.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-10 16:23:15', '2017-11-10 16:23:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010759018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165402', 'Stephen Carl Price', NULL, '11-10-17 Looking into HEP/Sedera for Jan. 2018. Leaving for vaca in Dec. for a long time. So, needs to do this right away.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-10 14:20:16', '2017-11-10 14:20:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010759013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001214017', 'Joe Morris', NULL, '11-10-17 Exploring this for her employees as group or for HEP/Sedera as indiv also. Sent her all info after our phone chat. Ideally she''d want to do this for Jan. 1st, 2018 if it makes sense. Not sure if she wants to give employees a raise or give them money towards healthcare.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-10 14:19:12', '2017-11-10 14:19:12'),
