  ('zcrm_1579374000010759008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990335', 'Charles Grigsby', NULL, '11-10-17 Shirley and her husband run own biz and need ins. as individuals this month but plan to include employees for Jan. 1st is their goal. They have 8 employees but not sure how many will want or need this. So, it could be 3 or more. They are aware of the extra $20 a month for 3-5 members. I didn''t think of it but maybe keep them as individuals unless have 6 to keep costs down. Bill is allowing me to help her since they are starting as individuals.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-10 11:44:06', '2017-11-10 11:44:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010744039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165339', 'Joanne (Jodie) Rigali', NULL, 'To Whom It May Concern,

    My name is Joanna Rigali. I am writing to cancel my insurance, effective Monday, November 13th, 2017. I have recently been hired on at a new job that is now paying for my benefits. Super exciting! Please let me know if there is anything I can do to help this process.

Thank you!
Joanna Rigali', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2017-11-10 11:24:17', '2017-11-10 11:24:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010755008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007792019', 'Carolyn Hope Clark', NULL, '11-10-17 She''s concerned bc C4 form showing no tax credit but that''s bc she didn''t accept the tax credit for 2017 bc she wanted it deducted from taxes at end of year in case income increased. I told her to take the tax credit this year to ensure she gets it. If/when she sells her house and gains a large increase in income then she can all me and we can adjust her income accordingly and decide whether or not to keep plan at that point.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-10 10:38:53', '2017-11-10 10:38:53'),
