  ('zcrm_1579374000010727023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129038051', 'Donna Manizza', NULL, 'Just ended Cobra at end of Oct. and has nothing now. Has thyroid issue and takes meds Synthroid. The generic version is $30 or so. She might want Brand version. She was pretty quiet and sounds a little uneasy but will need to look it all over to absorb it. Didn''t want to make a follow up appt. yet. Brand Synthroid looks to be only $43.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-09 13:33:58', '2017-11-09 13:35:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010727018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010815118', 'Kristina (Tina) Wood', NULL, '11-9-17 Tina has Hashimotos and under active thyroid. She treats mostly on her own with diet and herbs. Takes a wp thyroid med that pays for on own already. Understands concept well and likes it immensely. Husband is perfectly healthy. Ready to sign up on own with link and info I send.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-09 12:21:04', '2017-11-09 12:21:04'),
