  ('zcrm_1579374000010581003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005553299', 'Denise Boyand', NULL, 'Denise called in and requested cancellation.  Letter is in attachments.  I will cancel her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2017-11-03 10:02:54', '2017-11-03 10:02:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010567007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005185012', 'Larry Hutchinson', NULL, 'Larry called in and informed us of a address change and that his daughter had turned 26 and needed to be dropped from the plan.  I will advise him to contact LHS to get this done.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2017-11-03 08:54:25', '2017-11-03 08:54:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010567003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007427003', 'Timothy Nichols', NULL, 'Emp only $1000 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2017-11-03 07:54:22', '2019-05-13 08:03:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010546047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007427003', 'Timothy Nichols', NULL, '11-2-17 Enrolled in HEP/Sedera just now for a Dec. 1st start date. Chose $1000/$249 IUA and already has an HSA account that he''s been funding.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-02 17:52:43', '2017-11-02 17:52:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010546043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011171', 'James Margulis', NULL, '11-2-17 Started to fill out app and sounds like he got cold feet and says he needs to think about it. I''m not sure what the problem is. He said he''d let me know. I might call him to find out why.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-02 17:09:14', '2017-11-02 17:09:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010546039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509089', 'Denise Cahill', NULL, '11-2-17 Super excited about this. No problem with referring new people bc of her biz. Husband is on fence and is more traditional. But, she thinks he''ll join as well. Just needs to talk it over with him and apply within the next week. She did have a polyp removed and had to pay on a payment plan for 18 months $500! Insane. It was removed Dec. 3 years ago she thinks. So, she might want to start her membership Jan. 1st, 2018 if so. She''ll look at date. Husband has slight high blood pressure but completely controlled by lowest dose meds that doc says he doesn''t even have to take. Paying $1200 now with Anthem and going up to $1400 a month in 2018. She''s like minded and holistic in her practice. Wouldn''t ever receive chemo, would address naturally.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-02 16:41:52', '2017-11-02 16:41:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010546035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689078', 'Kim Gangwish Zahorik', NULL, '11-2-17 Sarah w. C4 helped us try to fix Kim''s account. Still working on removing Casey from account and waiting for APTC to be pulled over. She said to check back next week. I''m a bit doubtful it will change on its own. Tkt # 171 102 924 104. Kim''s income is expected to be about the same at $58K in 2018.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-02 16:08:50', '2017-11-02 16:08:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010546031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010634229', 'Denise Spencer', NULL, '11-2-17 She enrolled in HEP/Sedera moving from LHS/HES. She''s chosen a Dec. 1st start date. She needed help with Sedera''s portion of the app to login. Julie at Sedera got on line and was going to help her complete the app! Phew. Took 1 1/2 hours to get that far. She''s lacking in understanding of HSA even after much explanation. Otherwise, I think she understands it all, hopefully.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-02 15:00:17', '2017-11-02 15:00:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010546025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543055', 'Cande Lune', NULL, '11-2-17 "Cande was able to get a pretty substantial subsidy for 2018 and has decided to stay on her Kaiser plan.

Thank you for reaching out!
Hope you are doing well and best wishes for open enrollment!

Doreen Fitzgerald"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-02 14:45:52', '2017-11-02 14:46:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010555007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002071005', 'Joseph Butler', NULL, 'HelloWendy,

We will be moving to my company''s health care plan. What is the process to discontinue with libertyShare?

