Joseph Butler', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2017-11-02 14:27:45', '2017-11-02 14:27:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010546019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001347005', 'Lyna Norberg', NULL, '11-2-17 The alternate phone number is good for now while she''s on a sabbatical. Her primary will probably not work. She''s planning to send information out about HCS to her entire patient database with my contact information! Wahoo!  I will send her the RI information.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-02 14:23:11', '2017-11-02 14:23:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010555003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, 'Emp only $1000 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2017-11-02 12:19:22', '2017-11-02 12:19:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010546007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011171', 'James Margulis', NULL, '11-2-17 Jim is applying for HEP/Sedera right now. Single member. Might want to add kids later but by Dec. 22nd. He never really used HES/LHS bc didn''t know what doc to go to here. We will wait ''til April to do his annual wellness visit after the 90 day waiting period. Does''t want to deal with finding a doc to accept LHS.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-02 12:03:34', '2017-11-02 12:03:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010546003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012379061', 'Lindsay Patterson', NULL, '11-2-17 Super sweet. Pregnant now with girl due in Nov. Prefers HEP/Sedera bc no caps on per incident. Ins''t concerned about the $5000 total responsibility of have 5 needs per year. Also understands costs a little more and ok with that. Likes the tax benefits of HSA. Will have husband look it over and they will contact me after baby born to likely have a Jan. 1st start date 2018 to include new baby.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-02 11:33:10', '2017-11-02 11:33:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010537003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002095005', 'Dustin Spencer', NULL, '11-2-17 Chose his new plan with Cigna Connect since Vantage no longer offered. He will call Cigna in a week to make sure his payment is all set moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-02 10:48:49', '2017-11-02 10:48:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511217', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010342011', 'Marta Vera Wenokor', NULL, '10-18-17 Marta and Bill are mostly healthy. Bill is psychiatrist I think and Marta helps him in the office. Marta has glaucoma and Bill a list of things. Takes Allegra OTC. They chose to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 18:55:13', '2017-11-01 18:55:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511213', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010340031', 'Kevin Delaney', NULL, '10-20-17 Came via Matt Ross. Explained and he was ready to go right away. Emailed him app and he applied that night. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 18:50:53', '2017-11-01 18:50:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511209', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010331067', 'Tessa Manton', NULL, '10-17-17 Was paying $268 a month, only has contacts, no meds, healthy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 18:40:58', '2017-11-01 18:40:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511205', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010331085', 'Debora Doyle', NULL, 'Debra 49 and husband 50 living in mtns. Both have own biz, healthy, no issues, natural hormone meds paying on own called armorthyroid. Has HSA already. Choosing $599/$500.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 18:39:41', '2017-11-01 18:39:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511201', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010288013', 'Seth Owen', NULL, '10-16-17 Was with RMHP since Feb. 2014 and was subsized so paying low $200''s. Got in a ski accident and had neck problem May 2014. Turned 40 in September, non-smoker, healthy. When got LTC and life ins. recently got blood and urine test and all is well. He has daughter. He''s super psyched for this option. He grew up in Newbury, VT! Came via Matt Ross.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 18:33:17', '2017-11-01 18:33:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511197', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282015', 'Dan Gavere', NULL, '10-12-17 Lives in OR and is self employed. Knows Matt Ross. Paying $222 with $2500 Ded. Chose to enroll for Nov. 1st. Likes this!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 18:26:56', '2017-11-01 18:26:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511191', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010220053', 'Matthew Freije', NULL, '10-4-17 Has BC/BS high ded plan and HSA acct but they are discontinuing all indiv. plans in WA and he''s paying around $500. Healthy, no meds, 56, like sharing idea and HSA compliant. He knows of Karis Group and Andy Thorp. Not sure about referring 1 new person but decided to move forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 18:20:43', '2017-11-01 18:20:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511187', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010059111', 'Nancy Sutherland', NULL, 'Changed status at work from FT to Per Diem, therefore, lost coverage. Knows of Karis Group via Luke Facker. Has acid reflux that manages with OTC meds. Uses estrogen vaginal cream Estrace that costs $390. With ins cost $289.99 but she paid $25. Uses .1 % 1-2x daily.  Will live without it if need be. Uses Fluticasone or Flonase which is $15. Healthy otherwise and wants an ACA compliant solution. Enrolling for Nov. 1st start.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 18:18:01', '2017-11-01 18:18:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511179', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010512101', 'David Beecroft', NULL, 'David is looking into seeing if his current plan Medishare is accepted by CU. I told him I also have an ACA compliant solution. The only stipulation CU says is that it MUST be ACA compliant. They do not have lists and can''t tell him if an exemption is allowed as well. Son Damian is 18 going to CU this coming year 2017 Fall. I think he chose another option.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 17:34:46', '2017-11-01 17:34:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511171', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010512081', 'Mark Johnson', NULL, 'Discovered he can get his ins. for one more year through film industry association or something. So, will hold off on this for now. He gets great rates through his program.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 17:30:33', '2017-11-01 17:30:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511167', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010512071', 'Andrew Gorman', NULL, 'Did not enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 17:28:56', '2017-11-01 17:28:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010512049', 'Neil Breska', NULL, 'Neil has cancelled for 11/1/17 bc it was too expensive. He was the one who is a smoker also. So, not ideal for him.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 17:27:38', '2017-11-01 17:27:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511159', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001214017', 'Joe Morris', NULL, 'Referred Henry Young who didn''t move forward bc financially strapped with 2 kids and ex-wife choosing drugs over kids. Paula has about 20 employees and is considering this for her employees. We will talk on Nov. 8th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 17:26:45', '2017-11-01 17:26:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511155', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011905195', 'Candi Hawkins', NULL, '11-1-17 Spoke with Luke Facker after learning of Sedera through Appleton Clinics. Has son who is 20 and files taxes on own so he''d need his own membership. She understands. Husband has Type 2 Diabetes controlled with meds, non-insulin and also has sleep apnea. Candy does hormone therapy which she already pays for on her own. They have an HSA already. They will discuss it and get back to me. I''m going to send her full Guidelines to read through for diabetes. She will call me tomorrow or soon if want to proceed. Know the deadlines.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 17:17:55', '2017-11-01 17:17:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511151', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659481', 'Noel Fleming', NULL, 'Noel and his 3 kids are currently on Kaiser paying $687.84 with Kaiser Bronze 5500/30% HSA. He''s not keen on referring 1 person but now understands he doesn''t have to sell it or explain it, just connect me with the client.  He''s hesitant but is starting to understand it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 16:43:11', '2017-11-01 16:43:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010059177', 'Emily Wedgewood', NULL, 'Stephen has MS diagnosed 2 years ago. Thinks he''s misdiagnosed but it''s managed. He''s not certain if this will be good for him or not. But, probably good for wife and kids. Wife has hypothyroidism and takes synthroid. Found Sedera through C12 a Christian membership group. He''s closing down his business and now needs indiv. health care. Like Teledoc idea bc uses MyIdealDoc and works very well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 16:34:14', '2017-11-01 16:34:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511135', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010512023', 'Taryn Miller', NULL, 'Taryn started Aug. 1st, 2017. She''s an employee of Board and Betty Concepts lead by Dina Castillo.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 16:33:12', '2017-11-01 16:33:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543055', 'Cande Lune', NULL, 'She initially wanted to learn about LHS and Sedera. Cautioned her about LHS exceeded capacity and not a good idea now.  She will warn her friend. She also gave me a #720-275-9891 to call. They posted a sign saying Health Insurance for individuals, Families and Small Businesses to inquire about to see if legit.
I think she pronounces her name like Sandy not like Candy!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 16:28:10', '2017-11-01 16:28:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011905233', 'Joanna Egwuago', NULL, 'Joanna is looking at this for her 2 small start up groups with 4 employees in one and 5 employees in the other. She thinks about 7 people total are interested. But, Luke suggested she work with us to add them as individuals bc to complex to add such small numbers for each biz. She''s going to look into it and is thinking of doing this for 2018 for the companies. Told her the deadlines and told her I''d do a webinar to educate all employees at once. She was psyched for that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 16:21:07', '2017-11-01 16:21:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011624140', 'Nick Gould', NULL, 'Has Union Health Insurance now pay $4300 per quarter, $1300 a month, $17,200 annually. Ours will save him $8-$10K a year! Family is relatively healthy but they do take meds for ADHD, sleep and wife with mild depression. Sounds like meds aren''t terribly expensive. He''s going to discuss it with his wife and father in law. Looking to start this potentially Jan. 1st 2018, if not sooner. He knows deadlines and understands my availability will be less the longer he waits.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 16:20:34', '2017-11-01 16:20:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939106', 'Jessica Muniz', NULL, 'Jess has hypothyroid and understands pre-x clause that costs won''t be shared at all in the 1st year and stepping stone after. She has kids on CHP+ but we are uncertain of future of program. She may need to add kids to this later. She''s looking towards Dec. 1st start date. Currently has Cinga Vantage HSA Bronze plan for around $500+ for her and Daniel. Will likely choose the $485/$1000 IUA option since healthy and planning on no more kids. She totally gets it since she''s a nurse and she wants freedom to go to the best docs of choice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 16:19:47', '2017-11-01 16:19:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, 'Ready to enroll. I sent her enrollment instructions. She asked a lot of questions and is now ready.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 16:19:17', '2017-11-01 16:19:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011905153', 'Liz Janson', NULL, 'Healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco, drink on occasion. Wants to keep Dr. Eileen Gallagher. Currently on Cobra ''til end of year paying $875 with BC/BS. Doesn''t currently have HSA. Wants to read about this and see trad ins. options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 16:18:06', '2017-11-01 16:18:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011905163', 'Steve Wise', NULL, 'Found Sedera through his own client and spoke with Luke. Had a basic understanding of which I explained the whole process to him. He has also looked at Medishare but really likes the HSA compatibility aspect since he''s had one for 10 years. Healthy, had ACL surgery in ''96, just recently put on cholesterol meds which he wants to decrease dosage when he can get back into his wellness visit which was supposed to be today but they wouldn''t accept his ins. card bc of the network problem. His cholesterol is likely well managed. I read the text from the guidelines to him for that part.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 16:17:39', '2017-11-01 16:17:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919695', 'Erinn Magin', NULL, '30 years old and never had insurance on her own since left parents plan bc it was too expensive and she earned too much to get subsidy. Earned $52K last year 2016 and likely $65K this year 2017. Healthy, no meds, only IUD. Went to ER 2 1/2 years ago. Bill was $10K and she had to show them her bank accounts to show proof of income and got bill down to $1K. Crazy!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 16:17:17', '2017-11-01 16:17:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954107', 'Shelby (Hank) Carter', NULL, 'Thinking of leaving his current employer who provides benefits and funds his HSA account which is at about $2000 right now. Only thing he has is takes Adderall and sees the Dr. once every 6 months for prescription. Otherwise, doesn''t really go to the dr. He realizes this sounds even better than what his employer was providing. With capping membership asked what if his referral can''t get in? Referrals can be bumped to the next month. Hank is 29 and a skier', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 16:16:46', '2017-11-01 16:16:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656162', 'Darryl Lyles', NULL, 'Had ins. his entire life but Anthem dropped him without his knowledge when they ended his plan last year. So been without ins. since Jan. 1st and got STM 3x for 3 months each but now that ending Nov. 31. Therefore, Dec. 1st start is perfect for this. He''s a snowplow driver and doesn''t have a computer. So, Susan Atchison can help him apply. He has his physical last year and he''s healthy. Only thing is that he had a partial knee replacement in 2010. No meds. We are talking again tomorrow so he can absorb it all.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 16:16:24', '2017-11-01 16:16:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610361', 'Jarod Carter', NULL, 'Wife has coverage through school district and they have twins on the way. So, they will stay put and perhaps join later. He''s friends with Jamie Lagarde who told him about this. Jarod has BC/BS now and his plan is getting dropped. He''s a PT and operates as cash pay practice, so totally gets it! Has meds for propetia for hair loss. Just needs to make sure doc hasn''t written that it''s for any other health reason since it''s not. Cost of phenestride/fenestoride is only $5. Send him info and enrollment stuff to apply. He will likely apply for Jan. 1st b/c lack of time to do sooner, but might try to do it by Nov. 20thh for Dec. 1st to save money.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 16:15:12', '2017-11-01 16:15:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010714068', 'Karie Walker', NULL, 'Takes 2 meds, 1 low level lisinopril/hydro.. 20mg 1x daily for high blood pressure, well managed and other for pigment glaucoma for pressure in eye that will go away with age. She''s not concerned about this for pre-x. Super excited about this and we have a follow up appt to complete the process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 16:14:34', '2017-11-07 12:33:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010511007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024401', 'Merily Pompa', NULL, 'Super healthy! Husband was a chiropractor but now they''ve started biz called Health Centers of the Future. They believe in no immunizations, no pharmcaeticals, no chemo ever!  No pre-x. They have an HSA account also. She''s paying about twice our cost. She had only one incident where son had ski accident and was airlifted off hill. Bill was $70K and paid nothing bc of accident rider. She was referred by guy named Dominic Bali. She doesn''t seem to know him well bc didn''t know if he gets it through his employer.  If she likes this she might be interested in sharing it with their clients or in the presentations!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 16:13:26', '2017-11-01 16:13:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010508011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508170', 'Vanessa Adam', NULL, 'All healthy, no tobacco, no meds. Also want to include their employees, family of 4 and 1 individual. Probably still need to set up as individuals. Yes, has and likes HSA. Wants me to check on Aspen Valley Pediatrics, Dr. Borchers, All Valley Women''s Care, Aspen Medical Care. All are 37 or younger. The individual is 26 or 27.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 14:46:07', '2017-11-01 14:46:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010506011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033139', 'Kim Rew', NULL, '11.01.17:  Kim called - had ACA, now does not have insurance for herself &amp; her husband, Kevin. Explained HEP, emailed flyer, fee schedule, and link to video.
