  ('zcrm_1579374000010508003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011905175', 'Darrell Sigmond', NULL, 'Turning 58 in a few weeks. No smoking, no drinking, some exercise. Found Sedera in Google Search and spoke with Johnna who referred to MPB. Fairly healthy, has allergies and takes OCT meds. Has been self pay for last 5 years. Wife turning 65 soon and going onto Medicare. Priced out options and it would be $1900 for worst bronze plan for 2 of them and $10K ded or $2600 for Silver. Used to have HSA account and used up those funds. Like idea of HSA. Understands if does Dec. 1st start he can move his $ in taxed savings account to HSA account and get tax benefits for 2017 and 2018! Like that idea if he can get his wife sorted out in time and make the decision.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-01 13:03:42', '2017-11-01 13:03:42'),
