  ('zcrm_1579374000010352019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004509002', 'Jerry Hardy', NULL, 'Spoke with Jeff Kanter on Wednesday, 10-25, 2017 about this group.  He told me that we are not set-up with Sedera to handle a group of this size due the compliance issues related to the the MEC coverage.  He requested I send him an email outlining what Integrity is seeking, size of group and other details so he and Rod can discuss this live opportunity with Sedera on the schedule conference call.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2017-10-25 19:52:58', '2017-10-25 19:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010352015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004509002', 'Jerry Hardy', NULL, 'Spoke with Jerry Hardy on Friday, 10-20-17.  He ask for me to meet with him to discuss MCS with him, Toby and Tom.  Tom is the Owner, Toby is a partner.  Jerry handles the Insurance division of the employee leasing company.  Jerry would like to have a Master Agreement with HES &amp; Sedera for a perpetual enrollment program.  Spoke to Rod and he indicated we can do that for them.  This case has approximately 8,000+ W2 employees.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2017-10-25 19:49:44', '2017-10-25 19:49:44'),
