  ('zcrm_1579374000010279015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005030048', 'John Chamberlin', NULL, '10-18-17 Daughter has been diagnosed with Lyme Disease. Seeing Dr. Kehoe at Sound Clinic in Boulder. They are doing similar stuff as Shelley with supplements, drops, change in diet, etc. They found a Meetup Group for Lyme Disease folks. Read that taking Claridin can help pull spirocites into blood and then good to sweat it out of blood but not through exercise. They may try that with their daughter. Not the best idea to swtich to HEP now. But, he wants to refer new folks to HEP and I sent him the new RI form to complete. He has someone in mind to send me already. Super nice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-10-18 20:41:20', '2017-10-18 20:41:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000010279003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282165', 'Alicia Turbidy', NULL, '10-18-17 Alicia had breast cancer 14 years ago. John (JB) had melanoma on leg and face. One was in 2013 and one last Nov. 2016 and did MOES to get rid of it. She understands risk that they will have to pay on their own expenses if further issues with that. They have an older daughter in college who is on college plan and 16 year old will be on this plan. I need to check on Aspen Valley Peds., Dr. Fahey. Aspen Center for Women''s Health is Dr. Gail King, Vail Dermatology is Dr. Nern (but moot since not wellness visit). She might refer Christa Clee whose a realtor in Aspen. I should reach out to Aspen Realtors Associations. They desperately need help. Paying $2190 with Anthem right now! Will save $1389 a month!!!!  $16,668 a year! Enrolling right now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-10-18 15:53:40', '2017-10-18 15:58:33'),
