  ('zcrm_1579374000010256007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, '10-17-17 Christine asked a few more questions and will have one final discussion with her husband and knows deadline of 20th. She was asking about sons acne and accutane. I told her about Frank at Whole Foods and borage oil and she will try it first. She knows Frank!!!!  She took accutane herself and had no problems. I told her my weird repercussions. She was appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-10-17 15:15:12', '2017-10-17 15:15:12'),
