Dear Jennifer,


Thanks for speaking with our wellness dept. regarding your Health Excellence Select membership.

As a member of a Health Sharing organization, you''ve likely recognized that it is quite different from traditional Health Insurance. To better assist you in navigating the world of modern healthcare, our concierge is at your service to guide and direct you to the tools and services at your disposal. 

If you have any questions about your membership, dial the Concierge at 800 519-2969.

Here are a few links that will be helpful.

Our suite of services: http://gotomybenefits.com/ - become an excellent "Self Pay Patient"

My AHE Wellness platform: https://www.myaheportal.com/en/login/ - Get and stay well, set goals, track your progress.

My AHE Mobile App: http://m.myahe.org - Health and Wellness on the go.

Your Liberty ShareBox: https://www.libertyhealthshare.org/account/login - Manage your medical bills.

Shortly, you will be receiving an invitation to join WellFit and create an account.  Take the time to accept the invitation and join the community.  This is where you will access everything from your personal concierge, your healthcare advocate, medical cost mitigation tools and your personalized wellness portal.  There are wide range of educational resources at your disposal to help you achieve and maintain wellness. This is the single most effective way to avoid the high cost of "disease management" and the high cost of coping with chronic medical conditions.

Your Wellness Coordinator will be reaching out to you soon.

Feel free to call on me with any questions.  I look forward to speaking with you.


