  ('zcrm_1579374000009306011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003748040', 'Natalie Lampert', NULL, 'Natalie,

After researching your medications, Methylphenidate ER is, in fact, a controlled substance and as such can''t be shipped via mail order.
Of all the discount services we utilize, GoodRx has the lowest price.

Kelnor 1-35 offers no savings through mail order because the shipping costs offset any price savings.  All the discount services we use are priced right around $30.
You''ve done your research well.

Liberty only shares in the cost of prescriptions when associated with treatment of an injury or illness.  They would consider kelnor as a "maintenance" medication which is not eligible for sharing.  Sorry for not having better news.

In light of our inability to offer significant savings for your medications, I will go ahead and process your cancellation request.

Let me know if you have any additional questions.


Best regards,', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2017-08-29 12:22:06', '2017-08-29 12:22:06'),
