  ('zcrm_1579374000007909003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000304744', 'Dale Tokarsky', NULL, 'Called LHS on May 15th to cancel.  Was effective 5/31/2017.  Has obtained other coverage.  Wants to cancel HES as well.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2017-06-07 10:03:16', '2017-06-07 10:03:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000007892007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007888035', 'Deidra Heindle', NULL, 'Met Deidra at Allstate meeting in Sarasota, FL.  Discussed MCS with her.  She is an independent benefits agent and has numerous individuals and small groups she works with Allstate.  She invited me (Ron) to a meeting on 6-8-17 to discuss and present the Sadera/MPB group platform benefits and how we can work together on such cases.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2017-06-07 08:43:38', '2017-06-07 08:43:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000007892003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007888003', 'Mark Fishwick', NULL, 'Jeff forward me this lead.  He ask me to contact Mark about Sedera.  But this lead actually came from Liz Malone who gave Jeff Mark Fishwick''s name to call him and  discuss Sedera.  I called Jeff back and after speaking with Mark who does have interest and he agreed he should contact Liz and let her move forward with the lead and not me.  I considered this opportunity closed related to me (Ron).', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2017-06-07 07:59:41', '2017-06-07 07:59:41'),
