  ('zcrm_1579374000007745046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007755001', 'Jay Mogavero', NULL, '05.25.17:  Recvd. call from Jay Mogavero - referred by Carlos Gamiz.  Jay is interested in health care program for himself.  He works for State Farm Insurance but needs his own plan.  Asked for more info. to be sent to him.  Emailed him Sedera info.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-05-25 15:26:38', '2017-05-25 15:26:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000007745042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165513', 'Christine Pietras', NULL, '5-25-17 Called Christine and she has updated card with LHS already and just updated it with me now. Her account is current and paid now. Trans Id- 40120012443.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-05-25 11:38:25', '2017-05-25 11:38:25'),
