  ('zcrm_1579374000007629011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006255121', 'Debbie Lopez', NULL, 'This email will serve as my notice to cancel my health-share program, policy, # 062292389 for Debbie and Landon Lopez. Cancellation date for May 31, 2017. I have been hired on as a full time employee with Sterling Energy Investments, where I will receive health insurance benefits, beginning June 1, 2017. 

