  ('zcrm_1579374000007512011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005553477', 'James Heaton', NULL, 'Jennie, per our phone conversation the morning of 5/8/17 about the cancellation of services.  I contacted Nate at Liberty Health (855-585-4237 ext. 1754) and his records indicated that I did indeed cancel my membership with them on 3/21/17. Nate said he would follow up with Health Excellence with a phone call and email and would email me with proof of our conversation.  Thank you so much for your attention to this and for crediting my credit card for the 5/6/17 charge of $50.00.  Thank You

