  ('zcrm_1579374000007512003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005553477', 'James Heaton', NULL, 'Member called to cancel he is going onto Medicare.   He cancelled with LHS on 3/21/17 but did not know that he needed to cancel with us as well.  Asked him to email us a cancellation request.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2017-05-08 09:00:47', '2017-05-08 09:00:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000007493035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007494001', 'Carlos Gamiz', NULL, '05.05.17:  Sent Carlos Sedera Sharing Guide &amp; FAQs sheet.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-05-05 14:11:19', '2017-05-05 14:42:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000007493031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007494001', 'Carlos Gamiz', NULL, '05.04.17:  Called - l/m for Carlos to call me to discuss Sedera.  Said I would send him some Sedera Employee Healthcare Sharing Guide.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-05-05 14:10:56', '2017-05-05 14:42:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000007493027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007494001', 'Carlos Gamiz', NULL, '05.02.17:  Was notified by HES Carlos is a new lead. Recvd. text from Carlos - wants more info.  He went on HES site, completed form(?).  I told him we are having a Sedera training tomorrow and asked if he wanted to attend. Said he''d like to but has other mtgs. scheduled. Told him I would get the info. and send it to him.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-05-05 14:09:26', '2017-05-05 14:09:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000007493023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007494001', 'Carlos Gamiz', NULL, '04.27.17:  Carlos called me. Interested in HES for his family of 4 - all are healthy. I explained we are in the process of changing health sharing services and will give him new info. (Sedera) when I receive it - in a few days.  He said he''s not in a rush.  He works for Humana as a licensed health insurance agent but may be leaving and will need his own health care coverage for his family. His group insurance costs him 1,000/mo. and 6,400 deductible.  He may be interested in offering Sedera pkge.  He listens to "Family Talk" - Calvary Chapel, on radio.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-05-05 14:06:59', '2017-05-05 14:44:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000007493019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007494009', 'Darlene Kearns', NULL, '05.04.17:  Called Darlene to thank her for attending training, ask how she is (has the flu) and ask for her email address.  Asked her to c/b when she is free.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-05-05 13:50:50', '2017-05-05 13:50:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000007493015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007494009', 'Darlene Kearns', NULL, '05.03.17:  Darlene attended Sedera training. She said she is interested in including this program on her website.  She quit Humana yesterday.  I suggested we schedule a meeting to further discuss possibilities.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-05-05 13:49:53', '2017-05-05 13:49:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000007493011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007494009', 'Darlene Kearns', NULL, '05.02.17:  Carlos suggested I contact Darlene to ask if she would be interested in atending our Sedera training on 5/3.  I did and she said yes.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-05-05 13:48:43', '2017-05-05 13:48:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000007493007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007494009', 'Darlene Kearns', NULL, '04.27.17:  Received call from Carlos Gamiz - was referred by Darlene Kearns for our HES program.  Met Darlene at Christian Trade Show in 2016.  She was interested in the HES program but wanted to wait until after Open Enrollment as she was working at Humana as a licensed Insurance Agent for Individual and Medicare.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-05-05 13:47:10', '2017-05-05 13:47:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000007493003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005396035', 'James White', NULL, '05,04.17:  Jacque called Jimmy re: c.c. pmt. issue.  Jimmy said he never got an invite to Wellfit and no f/u calls from HES.  Jacque told him John would call him to help him with access to Wellft and setting up his QR code, etc.  John called and l/m to c/b as Jimmy didn''t answer.  Jacque sent Jimmy email to call John back.  April &amp; May have not yet been paid.  Jacque asked Patti to credit Jimmy for April since HES has not set him up since his Jan. 1 start.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-05-05 13:28:19', '2017-05-05 13:28:19'),
