  ('zcrm_1579374000007436003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165413', 'Irene (Renee) Barbeau', NULL, '5-2-17 Renee called to cancel membership with LHS/HES. She''s irate! Only went to doctor twice for annual wellness and has endless problems getting each of those bills paid both years. Now Boulder Medical Center or BCH is sending notes that it will be sent to collections in 10 days. Working with MedCost Solutions on this and now also doesn''t see the value in HES. She''s over the top frustrated. She has insurance through her employer already. Just wanted to vent to me and blame everyone involved about the fact that she thinks LHS is a scam. LHS will refund her the $75 annual membership fee but not April fee.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-05-02 09:54:12', '2017-05-02 09:54:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000007407169', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006886124', 'Mark Green', NULL, 'Please put him on hold for 30 days and I''ll post you back. Jeff', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2017-05-02 07:09:51', '2017-05-02 07:09:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000007414048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007427075', 'Heidi Casey', NULL, 'Employed full time but looking to stop working. Paying $600 with super high ded $6K. Family with 2 kids, son 5 and daughter 2. Husband prescribed meds for bi-polar.  Might want to let them know about Sedera in the future.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-05-01 21:38:08', '2017-05-01 21:38:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000007407161', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006982075', 'Ernest Sica', NULL, '5-1-17 He called to determine which level of membership he has and I confirmed it''s Liberty Complete. He also has heard bills won''t get paid but he heard that from folks who do Not have membership. I encouraged him to call and use the Patient Care Assistant when he begins to use the membership. His card is in his car. He wants to post this on FB and put me as the contact person. I told him we have another new option for group now with a different health sharing org. Perhaps he will share that as well. He''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-05-01 13:15:47', '2017-05-01 13:15:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000007407157', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005185175', 'Andrew Prinsen', NULL, 'May 1, 2017
To: pbaron@mympb.com
To whom it may concern,
I would like to give notice that I would like to stop my membership in the Academy of
Health Excellence. As I discussed with Patty on the phone, I think this is a nice service
and would be helpful if I more often needed to seek heathcare as a self-pay patient.
However, I have not used the service up to this point, and I think that the $50 a month
would better serve my family by being put towards our insurance premiums.
Thank you for your assistance.
Sincerely,
Andrew Prinsen
andrew.prinsen@gmail.com
303-941-1856', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2017-05-01 12:11:20', '2017-05-01 12:11:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000007407153', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007427003', 'Timothy Nichols', NULL, '4-30-17 He wanted a May 1st start date so I called him on Sunday which was the last day. Explained HES and LHS to him. He was nervous about providers accepting LHS. I told him worst case scenario he pays cash up front or asks for the bill and submits it with the help of the Concierge. He''s healthy, just takes something for loss of hair and other supplements. No smoking. He lives in Basalt area and runs own business as S Corp.  He''s making too much money for APTC and was going to have to pay $11K back if stayed with current plan which would cost $900 and crazy high ded. Has an HSA account already that he can use. Takes condroitin for joints. Fell off snowmobile and got checked out and he''s fine. He has back pain occasionally from slight strain. He goes to chiro for maintenance and pays on his own already. Fine with that since it''s not a new diagnosis.  Applied 12:11 pm 4-30-17 and approved already.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-05-01 10:32:28', '2017-05-01 10:32:28'),
