  ('zcrm_1579374000007407109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005371003', 'Donald Smith', NULL, 'Called in and spoke to John going on Medicare 5/1.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2017-04-28 11:46:25', '2017-04-28 11:46:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000007414032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165416', 'Tamara Kerner', NULL, '4-29-17 Response from Nancy C. "Hi Wendy,

Pam said this was a balance billing issue that has been resolved.  Please let me know if you hear anything to the contrary.

I know a few of your members have other issues, but it appears several issues I''m dealing with are balance billing issues.  If you suspect that in the future, you can let members know that doctors are not abiding to their contract.they automatically agree to when they accept payment and they are NOT allowed to balance bill.

The member needs to notify us, and that''s where I''m seeing some breakage occur. Members don''t understand that part, and when they DO submit balance bills, it also seems like something isn''t working internally either.

I hope to get to the bottom of this next week.

So sorry you are having to deal with this!!

