  ('zcrm_1579374000007157074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005259001', 'Bernie Frist', NULL, 'Please see the attached screen shot of the email advising my subscription was cancelled on March 13, 2017, and remove me from the Health Excellence Select program.  


There is neither value, nor advocacy provided by HES. John K provided maintenance Rx med options after multiple requests, and I found less expensive options through my local pharmacy and Sam''s Club memberships.  I asked John K for assistance graduating me from HealthTrac and although he replied that "he was on it," he did nothing; I had to escalate it with Liberty Healthshare a month later to resolve.  


I''m current with Liberty Healthshare and will continue to interface directly with them in the future. HES is simply an unnecessary and non-value added liaison between me and Liberty. 


Regards, 
Bernie Frist', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2017-04-11 08:49:23', '2017-04-11 08:49:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000007167040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004735023', 'Patricia Godale', NULL, 'Pattt called today to inquire about visiting her doctor.  I confirmed she is with LHS and HES.  I re-explained the two charges on her credit card.  I justified the $50/mo by explaining how Telemedicine works vs. having to meet the LHS AUA.  I ask if she received the HES Fullfillment Pk and she said yes.  I ask if she has visited the LHS website Sharebox and set it up.  She said no.  I also explained some of the value her $50 membership delivers to her.  She spoke about an upcoming doctor visit and how she pays for it.  I told her I would have John K call her and cover all the details and answer any questions she had.  I entered a ticket in the CRM for an outreach call from John K.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2017-04-11 08:03:07', '2017-04-11 08:03:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000007157025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005149009', 'Amy Faust', NULL, 'Hi,

Sorry I don''t have your name.  I spoke with you about MAHE.  THank you for explaining.

Please cancel the My Health Excellence account for Amy Faust.  I spoke to Liberty and and the representative told me that people do get automatically enrolled when they sign up for health sharing without knowing they are paying extra. So that must be what happened.  He told me that he has heard of it happening many times. 

I would like a refund for the months that I have already paid
because I was never informed that I would be billed. That would be 11/25/2016 $50, 01/05/2017 $50, 02/15/2017 $50, and 03/05/2017 $50 totalling $200.

Please send a check to me at:
Amy Faust
4096 Piedmont Ave #129
Oakland CA, 94618

Sincerely,

Amy Faust', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2017-04-10 13:18:27', '2017-04-10 13:18:27'),
