  ('zcrm_1579374000006936007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006928023', 'Richard Malvey', NULL, 'Richard called in frm Denny''s Hopewell and told me that he had just moved to VA from NY and needed HI coverage.  I told him he would be eligible for a SEP and could get coverage.  Enrolled him via phone via Healthcare.gov', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2017-03-24 12:04:51', '2017-03-24 12:04:51'),
