  ('zcrm_1579374000006899003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165416', 'Tamara Kerner', NULL, '3-20-17 WS - After asking for my help with billing and expressing I can''t help without her HES membership she called John and he agreed to help her and she said this to him, "Thank you so much for taking the time to help me John.
