Have a wonderful week.
Tamara"

Thanks John!!!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-03-21 15:14:57', '2017-03-21 15:15:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006874035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005832175', 'Paula Fabian-Leach', NULL, 'From : Gene Leach<gene@gblenterprises.com>
