  ('zcrm_1579374000006874025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636513', 'Ronald Rosen', NULL, 'Dr Rosen called in and had intentions of cancelling.  Said he thought he would not use as he is a physician.  Joan was here and spoke to him about being a Accepting Provider.  She will be sending him some info about this.  i will wait to hear.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2017-03-21 07:14:23', '2017-03-21 07:14:23'),
