  ('zcrm_1579374000006874007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165397', 'Justin Bogardus', NULL, '3-17-17 Signing up for IHC/Anthem Short-Term Medical starting 3/18/2017. No pre-x but he wants to see a dermatologist. Signed up for 6 month plan. He''s had very little earnings thus far in 2017 but may be getting $30K in the next few months bc of contract coming through. Also owed about $6500. Contract work he''s paid in lump sums. Last year MAGI was $10K. But, wasn''t enthused about Medicaid and wants to see doctor of choice. The $100 price point was much more appealing than $249 for HES. Tax penalties may go away anyhow but warned him this is not an ACA plan so might be penalized on income for 2.5% of MAGI. He''s ok with it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-03-17 12:21:13', '2017-03-17 12:21:13'),
