  ('zcrm_1579374000006834007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004608003', 'Laura Liebman', NULL, '03.15.17:  Was notified by Patti that Laura''s credit card did not go through.  Called - spoke to Laura.  She had to get a new card due to fraud.  She thought she called HES to update her card. She upadated card w/Liberty.  Gave her Patti''s phone to call and resolve.  Also told her I would contact the dermatologist she was referred to from Skellchock''s team to get him to be an AP.  Told her to email me his contact info.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-03-16 16:54:56', '2017-03-16 16:54:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006833009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000518266', 'Daniela Dadurian, M.D.', NULL, '03.16.17:  Called re: non-payment for March - l/m to call Patti or call me.  Sent email as well.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-03-16 13:47:28', '2017-03-16 13:47:28'),
