  ('zcrm_1579374000006823043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006824147', 'Andrew Malishenko', NULL, '3-10-17 Andy was referred by his wife Jackie Malishenko with BARA. He had health ins. ''til Jan and then UHC cancelled him without knowing it. He''s healthy, no smoking, takes 1 med, lamotrigine since 2008. Also signing up daughter. Andy goes to chiro sometimes, wife is into essential oils. Enrolled at 11:04 pm on 3/10/17.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-03-15 16:03:23', '2017-03-15 16:03:53'),
