  ('zcrm_1579374000006823035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165313', 'Denice Sparks', NULL, 'Greetings, Wendy!

Well, I''m having trouble .... the 1095A I was sent was incorrect on two counts.  I called connect for health and tried to deal with it myself, so I wouldn''t have to bother you.  That first call resulted in a closed ticket with no closure!  So I tried again, and have not heard anything back from the second ticket that was opened.  

The main issue is that they can''t seem to find a record of my having paid in January 2016 ... that of course is when the changeover from colorado haealthop to kaiser happened.  I did pay 13 times between 1/22/16 and 12/2116.  The 4 times that I paid over the phone were on 1/22/16, 1/26/16, 11/29/16 and 12/21/16.  The other payments were by check.

The other issue is that the premium tax credits paid were all incorrect.

It''s been a couple of weeks since my last call.  Are you able to help with this ??', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-03-15 12:39:06', '2017-03-15 12:39:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006823031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165313', 'Denice Sparks', NULL, '3-15-17 Spoke with Jeremy at C4 and he found her tkt 170 214-700 613. Says it takes 6-8 weeks to process so we still have to wait!  No way to speed up process. She might need to file for an extension to file her taxes. Emailed her the news.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-03-15 12:38:17', '2017-03-15 12:38:17'),
