  ('zcrm_1579374000006823007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009525007', 'Jill Suarez', NULL, '3-15-17 WS- She is hoping to have divorce complete in 90 days. Very healthy, no smoking, no meds, drinks socially, no extreme sports. She''s 39. She is excited about HES and wants to sign up. We set date for June 19th at 9:30 am to complete enrollment. Might still put start date out in the future slightly depending on the divorce. Told her all fees associated w/ membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-03-15 10:57:56', '2017-03-15 10:57:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006823003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002714103', 'Jill Jaynes', NULL, 'Member called in and said that she wanted to cancel because she wouldn''t use the plan.  Also cancelling LHS', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2017-03-15 06:48:52', '2017-03-15 06:48:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006805039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746016', 'Kristen Brown', NULL, 'Reached John and he will contact Kristen tomorrow morning. He sent her original bills to Lena Holden on Dec. 6th! They should have been handled already.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-03-14 17:36:00', '2017-03-14 17:36:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006805033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746016', 'Kristen Brown', NULL, '3-14-17 Kristen called and is PANICKED from huge medical bills from a heart procedure done in Nov. Bills were sent to John on Dec. Bills were loaded to system until mid Jan. Now it''s mid March. close to or past the 45-60 day deadline. She said some of the small bills have been paid but none of the large ones. She''s getting collection notices on them. They called LHS to ask for pre-auth and was told they don''t need any pre-auth to just go. This is a New condition from a mountain biking crash. BCH didn''t initially give her the bills but now they are forcing her to be a self-pay patient. In doing so, they''d give her a 60% discount if she paid in a certain period of time. That time has passed and now the bill is back to full price. Husband is losing his mind over this. Kristen wants to do their annual checkups and mammograms but they can''t until they get their bills cleared up. Need to have John call and escalate this immediately. She said some of the bills are still not loaded but she wasn''t clear that she even has them. She was flustered and confused. She''s paid $6K already to get them off her back. I don''t think she''s uploaded the ones she paid yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-03-14 16:40:42', '2017-03-14 17:35:02'),
