  ('zcrm_1579374000006805017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165413', 'Irene (Renee) Barbeau', NULL, '3-14-17 Gave her # for Concierge to answer her questions about finding new doctors to remove fibroid. She''s tired of dealing with BMC and their balance billing tactics for her annual wellness every year! I gave her Avista Women''s Care phone #. She updated her cc with us and I sent her instructions to update it with LHS. I''m hoping John can walk her through it all as well. She needs a helping hand to deal with it all. Final Balance Bill is $130.22.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-03-14 11:57:11', '2017-03-14 11:57:11'),
