  ('zcrm_1579374000006805003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005544267', 'Blaise Donadio', NULL, '3-14-17 Spoke with Blaise. He says his bosses AMEX card works with LHS and not with us. Boss had to replace his AMEX already and didn''t help. Now looking at getting a Visa tied to the same biz account. Super frustrated by our system not accepting his AMEX. He gave me a Visa to use for Feb and March payments but does NOT want it to be charged moving forward. He will call us with the new cc for April and beyond. LHS account is up to date. I just ran the card and it worked no problem with the Visa.  He was hoping he could just tie it to a banking account but not possible.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-03-14 10:53:36', '2017-03-14 10:54:09'),
