  ('zcrm_1579374000006780007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006151486', 'Jessica Inoue', NULL, '3-13-17 WS I just updated her cc with PDF form and sent her an email to double check it with LHS in her Sharebox as well. She said she called last week and they told her it was fine. Thinking she called LHS directly.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-03-13 11:41:50', '2017-03-13 11:41:50'),
