  ('zcrm_1579374000006774003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165403', 'Stephanie Soibelman', NULL, '3-13-17 Stephanie had John Kach and Carrie Litton Jordan with Benezon work on this Balance Bill issue. John submitted it to MedCost Solutions but nothing was ever resolved. I have Stephanie Med Cost''s phone number and also asked John to do a 3-way call to them with Stephanie on the line to get it resolved. She''s wondering why she''s paying HES if she still has to make all of the calls. She was also looking for a dentist in the SavNet network which she hasn''t had much luck with yet. I told her to ask Dentist if they accept Alliance Health Card instead of saying SavNet or Aon Dental. She will try.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-03-13 10:42:33', '2017-03-13 11:12:09'),
