  ('zcrm_1579374000006658017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191473', 'Florence Shelton', NULL, 'Spoken to Florence on 3/6/17 regarding her choice to cancel LHS & HES.  Long conversation...John K worked with her regarding several issues and she was very satisfied with his efforts.  But several conversations with Liberty left her feeling very concerned about their level of service and what was and what was not being accepted for sharing.  Cash reimbursements were also taking a long time to come through.  Also things that she called in for a pre-acceptance for sharing after having the service and  her doctor submitting the invoice was declined for sharing.  Todate her attending physician has not been paid by Liberty.  All in all she was very nice about the entire experience but felt Liberty''s services were not in the best interest of her health.  She enrolled with Florida Blue and has gone back on her company''s health insurance plan.  :(', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2017-03-06 12:47:38', '2017-03-06 12:47:38'),
