  ('zcrm_1579374000006536031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689078', 'Kim Gangwish Zahorik', NULL, '2-24-17 Spoke with Robert at C4HCO and he submitted a tkt to verify income we submitted already. So, she should stop receiving emails asking for income information. Tkt 170 224-715 404.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-02-24 14:01:54', '2017-02-24 14:01:54'),
