  ('zcrm_1579374000006470005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006461083', 'Jason Garvin', NULL, 'Family of 4, lives in Littleton. Came via Jessica Foster. Going to be self employed next month, healthy, no meds, no smoke. Using UHC Plus untli now. He brings his kids to a pediatrician who combines eastern and western medicine. Jason works with youth groups through his church. He enrolled 12-20-17 at 12:11 pm and he''s approved 12-21-17 already. Good to go for March 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-02-21 10:20:11', '2017-02-21 10:20:11'),
