  ('zcrm_1579374000006421077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003197105', 'Tammi Price', NULL, 'From: tammi price <tammi.price@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, Feb 17, 2017 at 11:59 AM
Subject: Cancellation and reimbursement for Dr. Tammi Price
To: pbarone@mympb.com

To whom it may concern,
This letter is to formally cancel the extension of my coverage for my health share with Liberty Health Share.
I had absolutely no knowledge of this extended service, therefore did not use it.
I am requesting that I am reimbursed for the $50 charge I have unknowingly received since July. 2016.
Connie Schneider is the person who told me about Liberty Health Share and although she has been very helpful, I had no idea she was my representative or that I was to be charged this additional money.
Thank you for your attention to this matter,
Tammi Price', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2017-02-17 10:46:14', '2017-02-17 10:46:14'),
