  ('zcrm_1579374000006421041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003359054', 'Brenda Hoopes', NULL, '2-16-17  Brenda contacted me and said she did not receive my information sent by email.  (I think she did).  I offered her to pay $150 to reinstate and she said that will not work for her.  I am re-sending HES information and will follow-up with her as last ditch attempt.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2017-02-16 11:32:42', '2017-02-16 11:32:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006421037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003359054', 'Brenda Hoopes', NULL, '2-16-17  Called Brenda to follow-up regarding her membership.   Brenda''s VM is full and cannot leave a message.  Special note:  Patty B said it''s been 6 months, if she agrees to pay $150 we can reinstate her to current.  Otherwise she will be terminated from the HES program.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2017-02-16 10:25:54', '2017-02-16 10:25:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006421031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003359054', 'Brenda Hoopes', NULL, '2-8-17  Called Brenda Hoopes to check on her HES enrollment status.  She has not paid for 6 months.  Brenda claimed she did not cancel but did not know she if she was enrolled or not.  I requested he CC number to get her back into HES but she want to re-visit what the benefits are.  I sent her some information by email but have not heard back from Brenda.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2017-02-16 10:22:39', '2017-02-16 10:22:56'),
