  ('zcrm_1579374000006421019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006092051', 'Ricky Kittredge', NULL, '2-16-17  Ron P called Rick to follow-up on his decision to enroll.  He said NO and ask to cancel his application.  I instructed him to call Liberty to cancel or it would self-terminate with no action or reply.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2017-02-16 09:40:57', '2017-02-16 09:40:57'),
