  ('zcrm_1579374000006202015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006191087', 'Drew Tarkington', NULL, '1-30 and 1-31-17 Came via Traci Hoops. Both are currently 31 and healthy, no pre-x. Read white paper. Thinking about birth and maternity in the future. Drew does ortho medical sales for work and totally understands how the industry works and why HES works! He works as a contractor. Brittany''s doc is Dr. Zara Frankel at 303-494-5263. Enrolled at 3:32 pm. Approved already as of 2-3-17.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-02-03 11:33:01', '2017-02-03 11:33:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006202011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006191133', 'Khrystyna Balushka', NULL, '1-31-17 WS- Decided to apply and move forward. Completed app at 5:55 pm and wants Feb. 1st start date which we moved through. She''s approved already. All set today 2-3-17.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-02-03 11:27:35', '2017-02-03 11:27:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006202007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006191133', 'Khrystyna Balushka', NULL, '1-27-17 Came to me via Melissa Smith. Super healthy, no meds, just bc, no smoking, goes to gym, yoga, juices, artist, etc. 32 years old, single member. Her current ins. went up to $300 so she doesn''t have insurance. More concerned about getting crowns and fillings for teeth. Works with Dr. Joseph Favor Dentist at Gillcrest Drive 77007. Wants free exams and 2 cleanings with insurance. Told her I can olny help with Discount cards in TX. She was going to think it over.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-02-03 11:26:13', '2017-02-03 11:26:13'),
