  ('zcrm_1579374000006157056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005956017', 'Janet Crawley', NULL, '2-2-17 2-2-17 Don opted into HealthTrac but then LHS wasn''t able to answer his questions about pre-x when he called to talk with them about it. Lost sleep over it and decided to stick with regular ins. Live in WA so he got it on his own.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-02-02 16:47:34', '2017-02-02 16:48:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006157052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006151512', 'August Palmisano', NULL, 'This was one of Jim''s training sales long ago. Known as Gus. It was his 4th Training Sale.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-02-02 16:14:34', '2017-02-14 11:33:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006157048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165413', 'Irene (Renee) Barbeau', NULL, '2-2-17 Renee called me and is frustrated bc this years annual wellness visit she is getting billed for again for part of the bill. Wanted # for Concierge and is super frustrated. She wants to cancel as soon as she gets these bills taken care of. She told BMC to code as wellness and the bill says wellness but I don''t know if CPT code is wrong. She did have to go in an extra time because she had her period the first time and they couldn''t do the tests. She will call John Kach for help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-02-02 15:29:22', '2017-02-02 15:29:22'),
