  ('zcrm_1579374000006157017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165314', 'Margery Belcastro', NULL, '2-1-17 Margie called and wants 2014 tax forms. I directed her to call C4HCO to obtain those.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-02-01 11:50:49', '2017-02-01 11:50:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006170043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005956063', 'Susan Laughlin', NULL, 'This new member was billed on the 1st of the month in error.  I have changed the billing date to 5th of the month.  I will notify her via email', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2017-02-01 10:14:54', '2017-02-01 10:14:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006157013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165380', 'Robert Woodward', NULL, '2-1-17 Spoke with Nicole at C4HCO to change start date to 2-1-17. She wrote up a ticket 170 201-680 434. Rob will receive an email when ticket is closed. Then should look to see start date at that point.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-02-01 09:27:31', '2017-02-01 09:27:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006157009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165380', 'Robert Woodward', NULL, '1-31-17 Jackie and I got Rob enrolled in a Cigna plan but the start date option was not available to choose 2-1-17 start date. Was on hold with C4HCO for over 45 min and had to get off to help other clients.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-02-01 09:26:33', '2017-02-02 13:52:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006170007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011283', 'Rachel Thibodeaux', NULL, '1-31-17 Rachel and I called LHS to find out why she hasn''t been charged the $135 yet. They said because she''s not starting until March 1st they won''t charge it until it''s much closer to March 1st. I suggested she call me if she doesn''t see the payment come out after March 5th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-31 14:08:54', '2017-01-31 14:08:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006170003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001318001', 'Matthew Foster', NULL, '1-31-17 Jessica is looking to be added to membership very soon. But, just mentioned need for liver ultrasound. So, she might want to hold off on applying until takes care of that. I told her pre-x clause again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-31 12:45:28', '2017-01-31 12:45:28'),
