  ('zcrm_1579374000006132015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005832265', 'Susan Clarke', NULL, '1-30-17 Asked to be cancelled because she signed up for regular insurance before she was finally approved with LHS. She decided insurance was better fit. Sounds like she never received approval notice from LHS. Showing as approved here but now I''m wondering...too late to salvage it seems. Enrolled back in early-mid Dec. Grrr...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-30 16:50:04', '2017-01-30 16:50:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006132011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004607205', 'Cynthia Toline', NULL, '1-30-17 I just switched this client to Analisa from Jolie. Apparently Jolie did it under Analisa''s name as the referral and Analisa is taking charge of helping this client. Client signed up for Nov. 1st start date and payment did not go through on LHS''s end. Client now has broken hip and provider contacted LHS but LHS says her membership has been cancelled or was never active. Account is getting looked at now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-30 14:57:12', '2017-01-30 14:57:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006111049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005973035', 'Lia (for parents Milton & Lizzy) Fernandes', NULL, '01.30.17:  Called Lia - l/m to c/b and let me know if they''ve made a decision on HES.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-01-30 13:38:45', '2017-01-30 13:38:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006111045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001763045', 'Jeri Caseio', NULL, '01.30.17:  Sent f/u email as reminder.  If no response, keep on C.C. list.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-01-30 13:31:49', '2017-01-30 13:31:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006111037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006123005', 'Craig Feeney', NULL, '01.30.17:  Texted Jimmy that I re-sent the email to Noelle and called her.  Noelle emailed me - said she will enroll Craig today.  Emailed Noelle instructions tips to enroll and told her to call me if she has a problem.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-01-30 13:15:24', '2017-01-30 13:15:24'),
