  ('zcrm_1579374000006111029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006091029', 'Michelle White', NULL, '01.30.17:  Called Michelle - l/m to c/b and let me know if she needs this for Feb. or not.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-01-30 13:09:39', '2017-01-30 13:09:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006111025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006123035', 'Doug Belton', NULL, '01.30.17:  Called - spoke w/Doug. He is very busy at the moment but is very interested in HES - has insurance so doesn''t need it immediately. Said he would review the info. I sent and call me in a few days.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-01-30 13:04:15', '2017-01-30 13:04:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006107060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006121016', 'Sunrise Jaramillo', NULL, '1-26-17  Had Medicaid 5 years ago when got divorced. Now Parent and 2 kids to cover. X doesn''t cover anything. SS 524 13 8711 Zaidee - 9253, Kai- 2017. Case # is 1BBFTC0. Can''t afford the lowest plan options at $250 or so. She may just get kids covered on CHP (I think) and/or just her covered. I realized she could try the lowest level LHS for $157 so she''s at less risk than just taking tax penalty and no solution.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-27 17:07:58', '2017-01-27 17:07:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000006107056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006102243', 'Ariele Myers', NULL, '1-27-17 Applied yesterday and approved already. Family of 4. Just moved here from NJ. Both she and husband are self-employed. Their Ped doesn''t accept insurance so HES may be perfect. They were paying $1300 a month. No pre-x, no smoking, no meds. Ariele is an acupuncturist and wants to promote this to her clients.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-27 16:50:10', '2017-01-27 16:50:10'),
