  ('zcrm_1579374000006081018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002734009', 'Sami Carroll', NULL, '1-25-17 Spoke with Sami. They can''t afford it right now. Teddy is still out of work. They make too much for a subsidy and CHP. So, they decided to go without any healthcare solutions for now until their financial situation is better. They were struggling with what LHS would and would not pay as well. They cancelled as of 12/1/16. She will let me know if/when situation changes in future. I suggested thinking about just covering adults or just children.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-25 12:17:58', '2017-01-25 12:17:58'),
