  ('zcrm_1579374000005732070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636215', 'Margaret Wilkie', NULL, '1-9-16 CC was charged successfully with LHS. Account is all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-09 22:17:06', '2017-01-09 22:17:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005732062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005765005', 'Sandy Spears', NULL, '01.09.17:  Recvd. HES lead notification. Called - l/m to c/b.  Sent email w/links. Sandy called - said she had lymphoma, is in total remission but having physical issues w/chemo side-affects which she is going to natural therapies for and is paying out of pocket because insurance won''t cover it.. Other than that she is very healthy and believes in natural remedies, etc. Explained healthtrac & preexisting programs - suggested she apply and see how LHS responds.  She is now paying $150/mo. through her co. and a $10,000 deductible.  Told her to look at info. I sent and get back to me if she wants to apply and I will help her with her application.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-01-09 11:06:39', '2017-01-09 11:59:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005748003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001350045', 'Jeffrey Wheeler', NULL, '1-6-17 Left vm to get his cc # for set up fees, etc.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-06 15:32:58', '2017-01-06 15:32:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005732013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005542023', 'Constance Trincali', NULL, '01.06.17:  Called - spoke w/Connie. She is reluctant to enroll in HES because, although she has been free of pre-existing condition for over 3 yeaars, she''s afraid if something shows up, LHS will not accept it.  I told her pre-exisitng has a 2-year limitation. She is currently totally healthy as far as she knows and has not been to a doctor in over 2 years and doesn''t have any doctors.  I told her we could help her with that.  We also discussed BIHRT.  She is having hot flashes. Said she would re-consider her decision and call me w/further questions.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-01-06 10:01:44', '2017-01-06 10:01:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005732009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005542023', 'Constance Trincali', NULL, '01.04.17:  Connie called - l/m to c/b.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2017-01-06 09:56:41', '2017-01-06 09:56:41'),
