  ('zcrm_1579374000005713017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005605101', 'Ethan Bindelglas', NULL, 'I received a VM from AMEX letting me know that they denied the $50 pmt I email Ethan letting him know that he must contact me with an alternate CC', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2017-01-05 07:05:32', '2017-01-05 07:05:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005715072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003743035', 'Julie Tara', NULL, '12-28-16 She''s a health coach. Helios Intergrated Medicine. Enrolled on 12-29-16 at 11:45 am with myAhe!0918191956. Has clean bill of health. Mentioned Tamara told her NOT to pay extra $50 for HES but Julie wants HES and definitely sees the value and wants the support. Julie was frustrated that Tamara hadn''t encouraged her sooner to sign up, sounded like.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-04 17:22:28', '2017-01-04 17:22:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005715043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692457', 'Roxanne Hall', NULL, 'Tyson 50 and wife 52. Paying $1500 with RMHP for 2016. No subsidy bc earns too much. Tyson has ortho stuff from mtn biking crashes. Had neck fused 6 weeks ago. Also xc skiing and tore meniscus and had knee surgery in past. Had lower spine fused 10 yrs ago. Has accident policy to pay for $7500 for accident and pays $68 a month. Travels, mtn bikes, skis and runs xc ski biz. Enrollment complete on 12/28/16 at 5:00 pm. Apparently Tyson injuries are too much so he''s been excluded from membership or chose to go elsewhere, per John''s note above.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-04 16:49:52', '2017-01-04 16:49:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005715039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676887', 'James Chambers', NULL, 'WS I updated pay to reflect 1st training sale.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-04 16:42:07', '2017-01-04 16:42:07'),
