  ('zcrm_1579374000005678041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005667061', 'orpheo mccord', NULL, 'Hi Patti,

I signed up directly with LHS. They have my billing info. For now, I am going to opt out of HES as I do not see what the additional benefits are apart from the concierge service.

Thanks, Orpheo McCord', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2017-01-04 09:51:30', '2017-01-04 09:51:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005677025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006293127', 'Julie Lerner', NULL, 'member called cancelled HES liberty directly', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2017-01-04 03:46:30', '2017-01-04 03:46:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005680125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005663007', 'Michael Herzberg', NULL, 'Spoke with Naomi, wife about Michael''s app. Signed up on 12-27-16. Live in MT. Their ins is going up by $500 to $1300. Chosing this for Michael.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-03 18:01:56', '2017-01-05 14:45:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005680121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005667149', 'Tonya Cauduro', NULL, '12-12-16 Entrepreneur. Health ins. through ACA no longer offered. No docs and prices way too high. Healthy, on hormones bc of menopause bioidentical compound, no smoking, studied natural medicine and alt treatments, naturo, etc. Turned 47 by now. Approved.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-03 18:00:33', '2017-02-17 21:45:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005680117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005663053', 'Loren Sullivan', NULL, '12-28-16 Friends with Julie Tara. Lives in Superior and wants to learn about becoming an AR with us after Jan. 31st. She moved here in July of 2016 from IL. Has a thyroid issue but health otherwise. Nice. Was distracted when filling out application but got it done on her own finally.  All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-03 17:53:06', '2017-01-03 17:53:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005680107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636631', 'Justin Kalinski', NULL, '12-7-16 Referred by Lisa Wade. Works for ReMax Boulder. Family of 4. Healthy, wife on bc and that''s it. No smoking. Was paying $800 in 2016 and now going up to $1000 in 2017 with Anthem. Jay or wife had internal hernia in July 2015. Application complete on 12:56 pm 12/9/16. Approved now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-03 17:33:15', '2017-01-03 17:38:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005680103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636609', 'Kurt Kincel', NULL, 'He''s Gretchen Reeves boyfriend. Can''t find notes, but think he''s healthy, no smoking, no meds. He''s approved.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-03 17:29:24', '2017-01-03 17:29:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005680099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636491', 'Kathryn Holt', NULL, '12-14-16 Healthy, no meds, no smoking, no docs, likes naturo, 31. Wants to see dermatologist and naturopath. Earns under $30K, 2017 est. about $40K. Zip 80301.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-03 17:25:07', '2017-01-03 17:25:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005680091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005654211', 'Hans Erickson', NULL, '12-12-16 No Pre-X, Surgery for broken leg and pain killers about 1 year ago and fistula tear. 42 healthy otherwise, no meds, no smoking. Completed enrollment on 12/13/16. Dr. Sheuer.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-03 17:12:43', '2017-01-03 17:12:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005680087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001177063', 'Kelli Davis', NULL, '1-3-17 Kelli isn''t in Cigna system yet and needs meds and leaving town in 2 or 3 days. Speaking with Monchel with C4HCO to push her app along faster bc it''s medical need. Told Cigna is way behind and probably no response until Jan. 10th for new enrollments. Nothing more they can do since it hasn''t been 21 days yet. She submitted app on 12/14/16.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-03 17:06:54', '2017-01-03 17:14:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005680083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165428', 'Sharon Valentine', NULL, '1-3-17 Speaking with Monchel at C4HCO and told me there is a 21 day processing time for submissions. Recommends to call CO Choice Health once a week to try to make payment. But, after Jan. 18th then let me know if it''s still not in system. Monchel made notes to the account showing the client tried to call to make the payment but couldn''t do so bc not in CO Choice Health system yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-03 17:05:27', '2017-01-03 17:05:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005680079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676847', 'Jillian Palacio', NULL, '1-3-17 Super sweet and appreciative. Just completed HES app, explained all charges and plan to send her an email to give her my contact informatin. Samantha Klinkner sent her my way and highly recommended me. Jillian is healthy, just accident prone. She went to a doctor for a bad bruise recently and also had a needle stuck in her foot by accident within the past 2 years. Otherwise, no smoking, no meds and healthy. She put her physical address on app but realized she needs to update her mailing address to PO Box. She did it in Sharebox already per my instructions!  All set to go for Feb. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-01-03 15:15:07', '2017-01-03 15:15:07'),
