  ('zcrm_1579374000005220093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011193', 'Andre Mpitsos', NULL, '11-29-16 Planning to sign up for the cheapest Anthem plan for protection of his knee. May also choose HES as secondary and to get past the pre-x stipulation for future. He''s applying for Anthem today or tomorrow. Called with questions which he got sorted out.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-30 00:22:15', '2016-11-30 00:22:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005220089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848047', 'Aine Carlisle', NULL, '11-28-16 I changed her start date to 1/1/16 per her request. She''s going to her doctor Dec. 5th for a colonoscopy bc she has HPV virus and just had a pap spear. Her doctor wants the colposcopy to be safe. Aine is not concerned but wants to take care of all of this first.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-30 00:04:31', '2016-12-22 16:44:22'),
