  ('zcrm_1579374000005220039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005223005', 'Barbara Savastano', NULL, '11.28.16:  Recvd. call from Barbara. Referred by my member, Robin Carridini. Insurance too high, she''s healthy. Interested in HES. Discussed program on phone.  Emailed her link to webinar and website.  Robin had given her LHS site to visit.  Sent in a completed Refer A Friend form for Robin.  Barbara is age 62.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-11-29 14:32:34', '2016-11-29 14:33:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005220023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005219011', 'Lynn M Paige', NULL, 'spoke to prospect, not interested; opting for health insurance', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2016-11-29 14:02:37', '2016-11-29 14:02:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005210041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002955601', 'David Warshaw', NULL, 'David received an email frm Jeff back in Sept telling him he had to "re certify" so he reenrolled with LHS for a 12/ start date.  I let him know this and he has called LHS and cancelled one of his memberships.  Tells Jeff everything is straightened out', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2016-11-29 14:02:16', '2016-11-29 14:02:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005201008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001175432', 'Lauren Wilson', NULL, '11-28-16 I think in my conversation with Wayne last week and in explaining how we get paid, he relayed that to Lauren who is now cancelling her HES membership. She has not signed up with a Liberty Direct Dr. and may be using that as a front. She didn''t want me to tell Dr. Tusek that she might join Cloud Medical. She wanted to cancel HES as fast as possible and doesn''t have time to add to it since she''s helping her mom in MN who is about to have open heart surgery. She didn''t know that I could help her with DPC doctors. She says she''ll call me when she gets back to CO. Here is her written request to cancel.

"Please cancel the My AHE portion of my membership (not Liberty Health Share).  I understand by doing so I am losing access to the concierge services and all of the other services provided by My Academy of Health Excellence.

Thank you so much!!

Lauren Wilson"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-28 23:53:36', '2016-11-28 23:53:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005188052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001230161', 'Kimberly Westrate', NULL, '11-28-16 "I am searching for health coverage for next year as my plan is no longer available. I''ve been looking at plans in the marketplace that accept my doctor and are affordable. You helped me last year and I would like your help again this year. I''m not sure if setting up an appointment over the phone with you is best for you or if email works. Please let me know which method works best for you.

Thank you!"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-28 20:25:56', '2016-11-28 20:25:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005188044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165315', 'Debra Jackson', NULL, '11-28-16 Debra is enrolling on new platform right now and decided on Jan. 1st start date bc not sure when Elmer''s is ending before he gets on Medicare.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-28 17:40:59', '2016-11-28 17:40:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005168052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001175432', 'Lauren Wilson', NULL, 'Member called, asked to cancel.  She recently signed with a Liberty Direct doctor and feels she doesn''t need both.  Spoke to Wendy who called member.  Still want''s to cancel.  Enrolled prior to amending the terms and conditions to include the two year clause.....', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2016-11-28 15:39:15', '2016-11-28 15:39:15');
