  ('zcrm_1579374000005168048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005244069', 'Danielle Deller', NULL, 'Called,received a voicemail, left a message', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2016-11-28 15:25:47', '2016-11-28 15:25:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005188040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001175432', 'Lauren Wilson', NULL, 'Put in request to Patti to cancel HES portion of membership and spoke with Lauren. She found Cloud Medical when she was researching finding a new physician in town. Now she''s thinking of just going with Dr. Tusek but isn''t sure. She wants to research it more first and see what other docs in town are DPC with Liberty Direct. She didn''t realize that I''m tied to them also. She''s not ready to commit to any of them yet. She''s in MN now helping her mom who is going to have open heart surgery. She''ll contact me when she gets back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-28 15:13:09', '2016-11-28 15:13:09'),
