  ('zcrm_1579374000005188036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005173170', 'Melissa Smith', NULL, '11-21-16 Referred by Laura Kupperman. Lived in Malaysia the last 4 years and now living in Calgary but has permanent address in TX where she travels to every month. Healthy, no meds, no smoking. Hasn''t had healthcare for past 6 years bc she could get everything she needed for a few hundred dollars a year. She thought the ACA was affordable and was surprised to pay even $249 for HES since she never had to get an ACA plan. But, she''s happy with HES bc it''s flexible and only solution for her while living in 2 places, US and Canada.  Already tried referring 20 people. She''s psyched to get the referral bonus.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-28 12:27:32', '2016-11-28 12:27:32'),
