  ('zcrm_1579374000005031090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004711550', 'Sharon Porta', NULL, '11-18-16 Sharon was nervous about the exclusions and about the God portion of LHS. She is choosing to cancel Dec. 31st and is getting an ACA plan KP CO Silver 3000/30 for $208.08. Enrollment ID = 128883921. Spoke with Monchell at C4HCO to resubmit her application bc it was spiraling and wouldn''t allow her to proceed to choose a plan. She will pay $208.08 and APTC is $562.99 for Jan. 1st 2017 start date. She put in banking information for auto wd. I told her to call me around Dec. 1st to cancel HES for Dec. 31.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-18 17:40:46', '2016-11-18 17:40:46'),
