  ('zcrm_1579374000005033019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001214249', 'Mayli Rose Perkins', NULL, '11-17-16 "I couldn''t figure out how to join Wellfit or the "Interactive Initiative".  How do I do this for lowered costs?  Also, please automatically renew my plan for next year."  I''m sending her to Concierge and reminded her of annual fee for 2017.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-17 20:42:07', '2016-11-17 20:42:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005033015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003413005', 'Jennah Synnestvedt', NULL, '11-17-16 Applied and accepted a few days ago.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-17 18:11:29', '2016-11-17 18:11:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005033011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001980009', 'Tim Brown', NULL, '11-17-16 Super excited that his membership is staying at the same amount for 2017. Was surprised. Says he''s referred a number of people my way but they haven''t called me. He will keep referring. Also reminded him of annual fee which won''t be charged until April 2017.  All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-17 16:59:39', '2016-11-17 16:59:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005033007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006274101', 'Wendy Wade', NULL, '11-17-16 Reached her and super nice. She and husband are starting a new business with employees and decided to go with a group plan. But, was super interested to see our option and will send people my way.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-17 16:17:36', '2016-11-17 16:17:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005033003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165453', 'Alison Burchell', NULL, '11-17-16 May need major complicated hip surgery from accident that wouldn''t get approved for surgery previously or for stem cell treatment. We found all but one doctor that she may need in the Cigna Vantage Network. That includes Steadman Clinic, Boulder Medical Center, Dr. Nancy Brown, Dr. Brian Blackwood, Dr. Cecilia Pascual-Garrido, Univ. of Colorado Hospital. Excludes Sherrie Ballantine. She''s going to call Sherrie and see if she''ll work with Alison on this. Looking at setting income at $16,700 she''d get $645 APTC. With APTC her premium will be $121 with Cigna Vantage Flex Silver 3500 with $75 Ded and $2250 MOP.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-17 12:58:36', '2016-11-17 12:58:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005032011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004711159', 'Robyn Carter', NULL, '11.01.16:  robyn is an active member as of Nov.1.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-11-17 10:36:49', '2016-11-17 10:36:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004984060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001123277', 'Elizabeth Malody', NULL, '11-16-16 Spoke with Liz and explained MPB, MyAHE, MyAFE, HES, LHS. She wanted to understand bc is going to write a blog. Wanted to know if she can cancel HES. Told her only after 2 years of membership. She said ok. Then I encouraged her to talk with Concierge to set up QR code, Living Health Assessment, help her track her bills and make use of Concierge. When she sees value she may leave it alone. Told John she will likely call soon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-17 01:00:21', '2016-11-17 01:00:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004984056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004711550', 'Sharon Porta', NULL, '11-15-16 After reading Sharing Guidelines she left a vm afraid it''s not a good fit and wanted to talk. I called her back and left a vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-17 00:52:14', '2016-11-17 00:52:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004984052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004833209', 'KayLynn Hanson', NULL, '11-16-16  Completed app tonight. He''s 5''11, 172 and wife is 5''6 128. Have two kids 23 and 25, not on plan. PCP is Dr. John Schultz. Carl has borderline high cholesterol. Takes Crestor 5 mg only twice a week and gets it for super cheap already. Wife had uterine fybroids, totally benign and nothing to do. Otherwise healthy, no other meds, no smoking.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-16 23:31:03', '2016-11-16 23:31:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004984048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006274101', 'Wendy Wade', NULL, '11-16-16 Have not yet reached her. Just left vm twice I think.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-16 23:23:41', '2016-11-16 23:23:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004984044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001538035', 'Jessica Hyatt', NULL, '11-16-16 "I''m wondering what other options are available for me and Keir. We''re finding that $429/month is probably not realistic for us (meaning, we can''t really afford it). Is there a better option in terms of costing less each month? I don''t really remember any more why we chose the health share aside from the fact that it would let me go to the local birth center if we have more kids. At this point Keir is making about 50,000-55,000/year."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-16 18:42:26', '2016-11-16 18:42:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004984032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000173913', 'Zoraida Perez', NULL, 'Quoted BC/BS.  quote is in ACA Express.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2016-11-16 15:23:28', '2016-11-16 15:23:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005007003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004997335', 'Lisa Spenner', NULL, 'spoke to Lisa, answered her questions. will ctact her in 2 weeks per her request', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2016-11-16 14:57:28', '2016-11-16 14:57:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004984028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004890043', 'Craig Keefe', NULL, '11-16-16 Looking to make sure ACA plans with APTC doesn''t make more sense bc will get an $1800 a month APTC for 2017 and cheapest plans are around $2100. Understand HES is likely the best option! Not certain his wife will be approved, so he''s trying to cover all bases. He currently sees a chiro who is his neighbor working out of his garage bc billing insurance ruined his practice. Made sure Craig understands he must get pre-approval for chiro with medical diagnosis. He see chiro for maintenance and only pays $50 per session. Will likely just keep doing that on his own dime since understands it won''t be shared in the first year anyhow. Just does it for preventative. He''s looking to complete application soon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-16 12:27:24', '2016-11-16 12:27:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004984022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167691', 'Catherine Dailey', NULL, '11-16-16 Just missed her call and she didn''t leave a vm. But, I called her back and left vm bc her cc needs to be updated now. UPDATE- Ooops, cc is fine. I looked at her account wrong. It''s all set on her MC. She has questions which she will call the Concierge about. She''s super happy with this and feels so much better about it than insurance. Her Dr. Kaufman left Dr. Thayer''s Group bc the Thayer Group is closing down. She thinks Dr. Thayer has cancer but that''s not being talked about. She''s planning to see Dr. Kaufman in Feb for her annual physical and they will give her a super bill for about $250. She wants to make sure that will be accepted.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-16 11:05:03', '2016-11-16 11:51:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000005002003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004236013', 'Becky Morehead', NULL, 'Was put on Health Trac b/c of weight.  They opted not to enroll.', 'Rachel Stewart', 'Rachel Stewart', '2016-11-16 10:00:32', '2016-11-16 10:00:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004941042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000877120', 'Andrea Thomas', NULL, '11-14-16 Enrolled today successfully in cheapest EPO plan. All set. I think she paid with cc now as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-14 22:00:38', '2016-11-14 22:00:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004941036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004762035', 'Traci Hoops', NULL, '11-14-16 Phillip says, "Traci Hoops enrolled on Nov 4th and was entered into Liberty on November 10th, we have not heard anything back yet on her enrollment.  I have updated the spreadsheet that Patti uses with her information."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-14 21:15:42', '2016-11-14 21:15:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004941028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848047', 'Aine Carlisle', NULL, '11-14-16 Left vm to let her know T&amp;C has been changed. Also her membership shows a start date of 11-1-16 in the email she forwarded to me from LHS.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-14 17:52:45', '2016-11-14 17:52:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004941022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165372', 'Jennifer Norden (formerly Fuentes)', NULL, '11-14-16 She''s trying to cancel her plan for Dec. 1st and getting onto a plan with her boyfriend which is a godsend. She will be losing $1500 a month from ex-husband starting Jan. 1st. Now saving $400+ a month not having to keep this plan. She is keeping my number to contact me about life insurance sometime down the road.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-14 17:39:17', '2016-11-14 17:39:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004941018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000919151', 'Devon Smith', NULL, '11-14-16 Enrolled today for cheapest Catastrophic Bright Health', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-14 14:50:16', '2016-11-14 14:50:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004921011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004455005', 'Carleen Andersen', NULL, '11-14-16 Enrolled for 2017 Jan. 1st. She put in cc payment information and chose to pay ongoing with the credit card. It should be all set but I told her to make sure she is charged by Dec. 25th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-14 10:33:26', '2016-11-14 10:33:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004921007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000877080', 'Andy Barbo', NULL, '11-14-16 Organized all employees to enroll with me today. Super nice and helpful throughout the entire process. Stayed with me the entire day during their day off.  Keeping same plan for 2017 Anthem Bronze Pathway X HMO 5000. Price went up $90 from 2016 but lower ded than others.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-14 10:28:07', '2016-11-14 21:43:28'),
