  ('zcrm_1579374000004895023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004833121', 'Gregory Olsky', NULL, '11-10-16 Updated to just Greg as member. Nancy Scheinkman and Nesta Olsky were denied outright.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-10 20:40:52', '2016-11-10 20:40:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004895019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004833121', 'Gregory Olsky', NULL, 'ARVD is Arrhythmogenic right ventricular dysplasia (ARVD) and NF- neural fibromitosis.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-10 17:04:36', '2016-11-10 17:04:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004895015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004833121', 'Gregory Olsky', NULL, '11-10-16 "Hi Wendy – I spoke with a nurse today and she took it to her supervisor and director and they both said no.  They won’t cover either Nesta or me, even with a permanent waiver for our conditions.  We both fall under categories with a blanket policy that the conditions are not accepted even though neither of us has had any issues since our diagnoses.  Very frustrating to say the least.  I guess it is one positive thing about Obamacare, they can’t exclude due to pre-existing."
 "I have ARVD and my daughter has NF. Both pretty rare genetic disorders. They can both be pretty bad, but luckily neither of us has been affected. Thank you for your help. Best, Nancy', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-10 16:49:20', '2016-11-10 16:49:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004895011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001123277', 'Elizabeth Malody', NULL, '11-10-16 Patti or John mentioned Liz called today to ask about difference between LHS and HES. Also wants to write a blog about this. I left her a vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-10 16:43:31', '2016-11-16 10:37:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004895007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004876167', 'Coreen (Cory) Nickerson', NULL, 'Met her in person at the 11-4-16 BARA meeting. Super nice. Both are self-employed. Son has partially torn ACL but did not do surgery and instead is doing stem cell therapy and they think it''s 90% better. Fully aware of pre-x clause. Another family member had left knee surgery 30 years go. Saw doctor 18 months ago for aggravation. Got MRI to look at meniscus. Not worries about it. Also someone taking generic for Valtrex, valacyclovir - 500mg.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-10 15:51:16', '2016-11-10 15:51:16'),
