  ('zcrm_1579374000004707228', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001538035', 'Jessica Hyatt', NULL, '11-1-16 Jessica''s response to satisfaction of HES- "We are happy thus far with our plan. Thanks for all the info."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-01 13:26:30', '2016-11-01 13:26:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004707210', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001350015', 'Linda Hescheles', NULL, '11-1-16 Linda''s response to satisfaction with HES- "I am mostly happy with this health care plan. I only had one significant claim and it took 6-8 months and many many phone calls to get it paid. But it did get done. I inquired about some pt related to a very old injury and I appreciated getting a phone call and talking w a real person about how it was still considered pre existing and how after 1 year I could get coverage. I voted against 69!  Thanks for all this info."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-01 11:50:05', '2016-11-01 11:50:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004701037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165403', 'Stephanie Soibelman', NULL, 'Left message...', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2016-11-01 11:29:54', '2016-11-01 11:29:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004707206', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165329', 'Pamela Clum', NULL, '11-1-16 Pamela''s notice of cancellation- "Hi Wendy,
Thanks for reaching out.  I turn 65 this month, so signed up for MediCare and for a supplemental.  It was my understanding that I was no longer eligible for Liberty.  
However, I am telling everyone about you and the Health Share.  It was a Godsend for me financially and they took very good care of me medically.  I appreciate you and the Health Share immensely.  Referrals will be coming your way because insurance is going through the roof this year and there will be people who need to switch.
All the best,
Pamela"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-01 10:59:06', '2016-11-01 10:59:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004707202', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001853007', 'Scott Swannie', NULL, '11-1-16 Scott''s response to if he''s happy with HES. "So far, so good. Haven’t had to use a doctor yet, but my wife is in the process of setting that up for our annual physicals. We used the prescription service once recently for an antibiotic, and the coupon they sent us save us about $180.00. So yes, happy thus far. Thanks."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-11-01 10:33:30', '2016-11-01 10:33:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000004721132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004711523', 'Michael Yocom', NULL, '10-31-16 Confirmed again with Patti that Mike Yocum is approved. Patti reconfirmed and Mike has already called to cancel Kaiser. He realizes his Indemnity plan is now unnecessary and will likely cancel that as well. He''s on board and excited to share with friends already, one of whom he''s already talking with.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-10-31 12:10:18', '2016-10-31 12:11:01'),
