  ('zcrm_1579374000004707033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165398', 'Andrew Hogan', NULL, '10-27-16 Andrew decided to keep HES after learning of the terrible options for 2017. Jen wanted to see if she could get a subsidy and choose a plan through Marketplace if she qualifies for Medicare and is on Medicare. I spoke with Melissa at C4HCO and she asked Supervisor and was told Medicare and Medicaid are treated in the same way. You can reject either of them but then you have to pay full price for marketplace plans. You can''t get a subsidy instead. So, Jen will likely stay put with her Medicare plan for $105 and supplemental plan for $250. Will email her now to tell her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-10-27 17:13:22', '2016-10-27 17:13:22'),
