  ('zcrm_1579374000004554024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004533005', 'Brian Mirsky', NULL, 'Subject:
Email: Final steps to complete your on-line enrollment Ext:1529

Scheduled Date:
10/17/2016

Comments:
Additional To: vokeyjr@yahoo.com
CC:
BCC:
Attachment:

Subject: Final steps to complete your on-line enrollment Ext:1529
Body:
Dear Brian,
You recently started the on-line process of filling out our application and it would appear that you have some important questions and/or concerns about our programs, our organization or some other issue. No Problem!
What is important for you to know is that I can help you one of two ways:

First, I can answer all of your questions regarding Liberty and - together -we can determine if our program is the best solution for you and your family.
Secondly, I wanted to make you aware that, with Liberty HealthShare, you have the option to enroll at any time.


As a group, we''ve chosen to opt out of ObamaCare and share our healthcare costs without the aid of insurance companies or the government. We invite you to join us!
I''m eager to help you in any way I can.

Lyndsey
855-585-4237
ldennis@libertyhealthshare.org

Status:
Completed

Owner:
Lyndsey Dennis', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2016-10-19 14:23:12', '2016-10-19 14:23:12'),
