  ('zcrm_1579374000003853021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003445029', 'Kristi Russell', NULL, 'Emily Collins contacted me on behalf of Kristi to look into this for her. I only communicated with Emily, not Kristi.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-08-26 16:45:13', '2016-08-26 16:45:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003853015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003524029', 'Terri Link', NULL, '8-26-16 She''s very torn about what''s the best option. Spent 3 weeks trying to get agent not knowing I could help her with that. But, isn''t thrilled with her guy either. Anyhow, she''s going to think over her options one more time over the weekend. The extra $50 for HES puts her over the limit financially but understands the importance with the Concierge. Also nervous bc of LHS growing pains and getting reimbursed and such. She may be eligible for Medicaid also since no income for next 9 months. She''s in a tough spot for making the decision. She''s think it over this weekend and call me on Monday. Also had chosen Kaiser plan for $214 with $5500 ded and $6850 OOP.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-08-26 16:37:38', '2016-08-26 16:42:04'),
