  ('zcrm_1579374000003791045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881018', 'Rolf Kirby', NULL, '8-24-16 Gave me cc information but wondering if he needs HES portion since he''s a dr. and doesn''t need meds, 24/7 doc, etc. Told him about savings opportunity with the Healthy Rewards Program so he wants to know more about that. Sent him link to gotomybenefits.com to read about it and see rest of benefits. Not sure when to run the card.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-08-24 17:23:50', '2016-08-24 17:23:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003791041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003176005', 'Jennifer Moen', NULL, '8-24-16 She now wants the CO Choice Health Plan Silver 70 since she''s pregnant. I sent her the application via pdf file so she can fill it out and return it. She has to show proof of her life change event as well, either her move from FL or loss of coverage from job.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-08-24 17:20:52', '2016-08-24 17:20:52'),
