  ('zcrm_1579374000003791029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165303', 'Mark Bowman', NULL, '8-24-16 Updated cc on other end and hoping it will run now. John took out old card and added correct card. No longer showing invalid since that entry was deleted entirely.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-08-24 14:53:25', '2016-08-24 14:53:25'),
