  ('zcrm_1579374000003753007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003724005', 'Debi Pender', NULL, 'Signed contract returned.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2016-08-18 10:53:39', '2016-08-18 10:53:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003751015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004078021', 'Natalie Canfield', NULL, '8-17-16 Spoke with Natalie. She had cancelled with LHS in May. She called LHS to ask why she was still getting billed $50 a month and they said they had no idea why. She took it up the chain of command with LHS to get to the bottom of it. She spoke with Keiona who then asked her Supervisor. They explained to Natalie that Academy of Health Excellence and LHS are two separate organizations. I told Natalie we will refund her the last 3 months June-August since she intended to cancel the entire membership for the end of May. I also explained that LHS has grown so fast and the new employees don''t yet know about HES, so there is often confusion. She was nice and thrilled to get the $150 refunded to her card. All set now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-08-17 17:23:29', '2016-08-17 17:23:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003751011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746004', 'Jared Schaffer', NULL, '8-17-16 Spoke with Jared and told him the invoices are going to his wife''s email address. She''s used the HES services. She updated their credit card in the system per John''s instructions with the .pdf file in June. Proof of email communication with John in May and June. Jared will speak with his wife and let me know what he wants to do moving forward with the HES portion of membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-08-17 17:09:25', '2016-08-17 17:09:25'),
