  ('zcrm_1579374000003702033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165400', 'Ross Metler', NULL, '8-11-16 He got new coverage through work starting 7/25/16. So, needed to cancel for 7/31/16. He cancelled with LHS already. His card was declined so he wasn''t charged for Aug. Cancelled now for Aug. 1st moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-08-11 12:32:45', '2016-08-11 12:32:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003702029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165400', 'Ross Metler', NULL, 'Here is Ross Metler''s response to the cancellation you forwarded to me.

"So I cancelled with Liberty health share, they told me that total was $224 I think and when I asked about why the charge to my cc was higher (250) they did not tell me about the health excellence membership. That''s where the $50 comes from correct? The math is not making sense to me. I emailed them yesterday to inform that my benefits health coverage kicks in 7/25 and cancellation should be effective 7/31. I guess I was confused about having two memberships to cancel. 

Thanks for your help,

Ross"

Ross'' card did not go through this month. So, he has not been charged for August. Please cancel his membership.

Thanks!
Wendy Scipione', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2016-08-11 12:31:00', '2016-08-11 12:31:00'),
