  ('zcrm_1579374000003367025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000941033', 'Gary Sahadeo', NULL, '07.18.16:  Responded to Dottie''s email.  Said I would get in touch w/John to find out how to get Dottie &amp; Gary signed up for portal. I also mentioned I called Maria @ Dr. Fronzaglia''s office and will call again to get in touch with them.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-07-19 13:26:39', '2016-07-19 13:26:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003367019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000941033', 'Gary Sahadeo', NULL, '07.16.16:  Recvd email from Dottie.  Has had 1 injection at the Center for Pain Mgmt in Delray and has another scheduled for 7.19.  Still trying to get LHS to approve injections. (Read email of 7.16 for info.).  Also, said she''d like to enroll for the wellness portal but has been having problems getting John''s invitation to get set up.  She also said she is ready to write testimonial for us.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-07-19 13:21:41', '2016-07-19 13:24:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003367015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000941033', 'Gary Sahadeo', NULL, '05.27.16:  Emailed Dottie response to her update to me letting me know that the naturopathic therapies were helping her neck pain.  Asked her to write a testimonial about John and me helping her.  She said she would be happy to after her therapy ends.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-07-19 13:15:46', '2016-07-19 13:15:46'),
