  ('zcrm_1579374000003286003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003176005', 'Jennifer Moen', NULL, '7-12-16 Completed application just now. Tried twice for HES portion and went through twice. But, used MyLibertyHealthShare site to complete health survey since didn''t forward me along. App is validating now. Needs 8/1/16 start date. Has an emergency plan for the month of July since coverage ended 6/30/16.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-07-12 12:34:55', '2016-07-12 12:34:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003242011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165303', 'Mark Bowman', NULL, '7-7-16 Jeremy Tkt # 160707-385005 with C4HCO to reopen account to access tax forms from 2014. If no email by next Wed. or Thursday we should check in again on status.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-07-07 16:53:15', '2016-07-07 16:53:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003242007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001634097', 'Dale Kurtz', NULL, '7-7-16 I spoke with Dale again and explained to him that the separate $50 fee is part of the complete package of the HES membership. I explained a bunch of the different benefits and support that it includes and that''s it''s their way of maintaining complete transparency. He understands and will do his best to explain it to his wife Angela. If she has more questions he will have her contact me. He''s not sure who she sent the email/s to in regards to the account. I explained I never received any other than the recent request to cancel the membership. Dale is on board. His cc ran fine now and account is up to date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-07-07 14:00:44', '2016-07-07 14:00:44'),
