  ('zcrm_1579374000003230003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003227033', 'Dawn Bartolone', NULL, '07.05.16:  Dawn is Alize Campbell''s mother.  She scheduled appt. to enroll in HES for her and her husband, Michael.  She has Type 2 Diabetes since 2007.  I suggested they apply and see what response they get from LHS.  Start date is 9/1/16. P/W:  Mackinaw', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-07-05 16:45:58', '2016-07-05 16:49:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003225033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001634097', 'Dale Kurtz', NULL, '7-5-16 Patti spoke with Angela and she wanted to cancel. I spoke with Dale and he said to run card and that it should work just fine. If not, he''ll have to call the bank to ask why. But, he''s on board and all is well. Patti trying to run it now...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-07-05 15:09:26', '2016-07-05 15:09:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003225029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005614021', 'Stefanie Overturf', NULL, 'Email sent 7/5, interested in her and spouse, and potential employees, 25', 'Linda Craig', 'Linda Craig', '2016-07-05 14:10:40', '2016-07-05 14:10:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003225011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165416', 'Tamara Kerner', NULL, '7-5-16 Updated CC with LHS and HES. Wanted to cancel HES until understood value of our meds program. She spends about $600 for Epi Pen. I just priced it out at $92.70 plus $9.95 for shipping. Already the membership benefits are almost a wash in price from her savings. Also wants me to send her Delta Dental Premier plan to apply to. Had done it for June but cc didn''t work so they didn''t activate the membership. John needs to resend the fulfillment package for HES.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-07-05 11:24:03', '2016-07-05 11:24:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003218025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002593005', 'Eric Nava', NULL, '07.01.16:  Nancy emailed me LHS notes - indicate Eric never approved HealthTrac membership. On June 1, LHS emailed him to accept or enrollment would be terminated in 5 bus. days. Eric did  not respond.  LHS called &amp; left phone message on June 21 - Eric has not responded.  Called Jessica - told her to call Eric. If he wants to enroll, they must call LHS and approve HealthTrac and start for Aug.1. Jessica said she would call him tomorrow.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-07-01 15:36:44', '2016-07-01 15:36:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003218013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002593005', 'Eric Nava', NULL, '07.01.16:  Recvd email from Nancy Coveleskie - she got confirmation from Angie Martin that Eric''s enrollment was changed to HES.  Emailed Nancy to find out how we confirm notification from LHS of Eric''s HES enrollment and how do we get commission for this enrollment.  Emailed Jessica update.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-07-01 12:44:51', '2016-07-01 12:44:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003218009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002593005', 'Eric Nava', NULL, '06.30.16:  Jacque and I noticed Eric was not in commissions for June.  Found out he was not enrolled under HES - was enrolled under LHS.  Told Jessica.  Asked Nancy Coveleskie to have enrollment changed to HES.  John Kach said HES would recognize Scott and Eric as a couple so Eric would not have to pay the monthly $50.  Got approval from Jessica, so that we will not get residual from Eric.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-07-01 12:14:01', '2016-07-01 12:14:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003218003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002593005', 'Eric Nava', NULL, '05.31.16:  Recvd text from Jessica. She had enrolled Scott Gideon for June 1 as a single enrollment successfully and tried to enroll Eric as a single but LHS wouldn''t let her enroll him - said he already had an app. in. I told her to call LHS on 6/1 to verify his enrollment.  They enrolled Eric for 6/1 start date and put him on a provisional program because his weight was 261 lbs. at 6''1'''' - must be 219 lbs.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-07-01 12:07:06', '2016-07-01 12:08:57'),
