  ('zcrm_1579374000003192017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746011', 'Laura Seraydarian', NULL, '6-28-16 Updated address to Pine St. address since never received Fulfillment Pkg. She''s all set now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-06-28 16:39:00', '2016-06-28 16:39:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003192011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746011', 'Laura Seraydarian', NULL, '6-28-16 Frustrated by getting bills paid from CO Health Op. Called to find out how to submit bills to LHS for recent visit and if accepting first doctor visit which looks like it going towards AUA for $111.03.  She annoyed by having to submit bills. But, is happy that won''t have to do that with Dr. Brown, Lab Corp. Hoping to have CU Hostpital for Misha Miller on board soon too. That''s in process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-06-28 13:46:50', '2016-06-28 13:46:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003192007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165314', 'Margery Belcastro', NULL, '6-28-16 UPDATE- Removed John from plan and now subsidy went down to $292.28 and premium up to $285.20! They are upset and I called Paul with C4HCO and he reviewed it and confirmed it''s accurate since John is off the plan. The system sees it as only one person in household earning $46K needing insurance. They will keep the plan for the moment. They may change the credit card it''s put onto. They weren''t super interested in HES because of the Annual and start up fees. HES will likely be the best option for 2017.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-06-28 13:39:55', '2016-06-28 13:51:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003192003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000168048', 'Lornette Browne', NULL, 'Ticket updated', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2016-06-28 10:13:23', '2016-06-28 10:13:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003190003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003039017', 'CarolAnn Maritato', NULL, 'Spoke with Carol she is awaiting welcome package for 7/1 start date.', 'Gary Lowe', 'Gary Lowe', '2016-06-28 07:19:34', '2016-06-28 07:19:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003168003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165410', 'Emily Franta', NULL, '6-23-16 Emily chose to stay with Kaiser for the rest of the year. She is taking 3-4 meds. Sounds like she''s nervous about the prices of meds for HES. But, was close to choosing that and will likely switch once she sees the rate hike.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-06-24 12:54:41', '2016-06-24 12:54:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003166005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003167005', 'Jackaline Brown', NULL, 'Enrolled Jackie Brown on 6/24/16', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-06-24 07:42:18', '2016-06-24 07:42:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003162003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '6-23-16 Carolyn called to ask for a Radiologist and GI for her mammogram, dexascan and for a colonoscopy since she just turned 50. She has lost 22 lbs. since eliminating carbs in her diet. Wants to come to next Money 101 and may need different menu option. She went to Holos Health for annual check up and follow up appointments. Holos Health submitted bill and paid Carolyn instead of the practice. Carolyn paid Holos Health their portion of the bill. I emailed Diana Kettelwell to make sure it''s reimbursed to the provider, not to Carolyn in the future. Payment was for $257.42 which was for the entire billed amount. She''s wondering is a MTHFR test will be included in annual physical. Ok if it''s not. It determines if metholate is metabolized in the way it should be.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-06-23 11:48:02', '2016-06-23 11:48:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003089006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165410', 'Emily Franta', NULL, '6-16-16 Emily reached out bc started a new job earning $37K. She no longer qualifies for a subsidy and her work offers insurance. Without the subsidy Kaiser costs $230.11 So, only option would be HES if company plan is too much.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-06-17 11:15:11', '2016-06-17 11:15:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003074007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003036005', 'David Carnahan', NULL, '6-15-16 Dave called and hadn''t gotten past Step 1. I got him logged in again but he''s now going to fill out health questionnaire and sign it in a day or two to allow his new credit union account to have the funds transferred into it. He will call me if he has trouble logging back in again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-06-15 16:13:03', '2016-06-15 16:13:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003074003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001696029', 'Keila Hoover', NULL, '6-15-16 Notified me that she will need to cancel her Cigna plan bc a new employer will be covering her insurance. Told her to contact them herself to cancel.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-06-15 15:07:22', '2016-06-15 15:07:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000003061003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003052064', 'Chad Hasselbach', NULL, '6-15-16 Chad just called me to check status of application because it froze on the congratulations page. But, Patti has already set it to Processing in LHS. Looks good. I reiterated how the money is charged so he''s aware of what that looks like. He was super happy and said John Vnuk explained it well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-06-15 10:34:38', '2016-06-15 10:34:38'),
