  ('zcrm_1579374000002872005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207461', 'Michael Schnelle', NULL, '5-30-16 Michael called me bc he had called C4HCO on April 21st to cancel his plan and to update his income to $0 bc unemployment ended on April 5th. Spoke with Paul at C4HCO and he can see the case has been given to Jasmine in the Back Office to update his income to $0 since it''s still showing his full income. We are supposed to hear from Jasmine tomorrow/Wed. and told us to call on Thursday if haven''t heard anything back. Ask for Tier 3 Rep or a Licensed Agent bc they sit next to Jasmine''s area to check in with her. She''s out today.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-05-31 11:47:48', '2016-05-31 11:47:48'),
