  ('zcrm_1579374000002696013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001110140', 'Craig Hernandis', NULL, 'Jeff K spoke to Craig. He had me resend the WellFit invite and I walked him through to the Home page. Showed him how to start the QR and the Assessment. He has had a billing process hiccup with the Cleveland Clinic and may contact the Concierge.', 'Advanced Consulting', 'Advanced Consulting', '2016-05-11 14:00:56', '2016-05-11 14:00:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002696009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001757205', 'Mary Carter Eick', NULL, '05:10:16:  Mary emailed her questions.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-05-11 14:00:34', '2016-05-11 14:00:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002696005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001757205', 'Mary Carter Eick', NULL, '05.05.16:  Mary called.  Wants to terminate her insurance at $1100/mo.  Has some questions about HES/LHS.  Discussed them briefly with her and told her to email them to me as I was away and would be back on Monday.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-05-11 14:00:01', '2016-05-11 14:00:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002686173', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191454', 'Jennifer McMahon', NULL, 'GL spoke with Jennifer did receive HES card has not opened.  Not sure of email but would like it to be resent.  She has signed in to wellfit community but has done nothing in it. Scheduled a session to walk through community and features available to her.', 'Gary Lowe', 'Gary Lowe', '2016-05-11 10:12:52', '2016-05-11 10:12:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002686146', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165427', 'April Porterfield', NULL, 'see support tab.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2016-05-10 11:05:56', '2016-05-10 11:05:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002690003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001037073', 'Linda Hinkle', 'HES cancellation', 'crm Wendy called - cancel member ok by me with refund for May', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2016-05-10 06:03:10', '2016-05-10 06:03:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002686007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001175486', 'Katharine (Katie) Armstrong', NULL, 'Call in from Katie, didn''t get package, or email.  Copying body and e-mailing.....', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2016-05-09 12:52:43', '2016-05-09 12:52:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002655007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001175432', 'Lauren Wilson', NULL, 'Spoke to Lauren re changing credit card, gave instructions', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2016-05-06 14:19:25', '2016-05-06 14:19:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002657007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001800013', 'Inna Petunina', NULL, '5-6-16 Theresa in Broker Services said that as soon as you receive the end of coverage letter from Cobra, please email the document to me or direct to Anthem at IndCONVMissingInfo@Anthem.com. The document # is G41460497287091. They will proceed with your application at that time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-05-06 12:36:17', '2016-05-06 12:36:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002657003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001800013', 'Inna Petunina', NULL, '5-6-16 Inna called and spent 2 hours on phone with Anthem and was told can''t guarantee June 1st start date. They''re so ridiculous!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-05-06 12:26:13', '2016-05-06 12:36:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002655003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001985009', 'Julia Quackenbush', NULL, 'Member called, was just hired for a new job and her employer is providing health insurance.  Asked to cancell her membership. I gave her Liberty''s number and informed her that she must call Liberty directly to cancel.  Informing Patti, Rod and Ron Patterson of her request.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2016-05-06 08:48:39', '2016-05-06 08:48:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002645003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002568067', 'David (Dave) Gerke', NULL, '5-5-16 John Vnuk is asking about status of Dave''s application. I told him to have Dave call LHS or do 3-way to call LHS and determine status.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-05-05 09:54:28', '2016-05-05 09:54:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002631003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002469017', 'Floyd Trujillo', NULL, '5-4-16 Floyd is coming to Money 101 without wife and kids bc can''t find sitter.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-05-04 11:10:42', '2016-05-04 11:10:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002620007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '5-3-16 Was planning to see Dr. Fran Hamilton tomorrow but saw some bad reviews online. After we chatted she called Journey 2 Life and got an appt for her and her daughter this week! She''s excited and feels better about this option. They can help her with adrenal fatigue. Now also looking to find a podiatrist to see because of external foot pain with skin rubbing.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-05-03 15:20:47', '2016-05-03 15:20:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002601003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167701', 'Mike Bird', NULL, '5-2-16 C4HCO emailed Mike with new plan details and all looks good with the 5-1-16 start date for the same plan he''s had just with a new subsidy amount bc his income is higher.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-05-02 10:32:44', '2016-05-02 10:32:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002599003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167691', 'Catherine Dailey', NULL, 'Sharebox: coppercat57', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2016-05-02 09:11:28', '2016-05-02 09:11:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002581033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002118005', 'Eric Nelson', NULL, '4-29-16 Completed his application for CO Choice Health Silver Basic 60 including Eric, wife and son. May only need this for one month before gets new job with benefits. Super thankful and plans to call CO Choice Health on Wed. to set up payment and ask for cards via email.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-04-29 14:39:11', '2016-04-29 14:39:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002578031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165343', 'Renee Athay', NULL, 'Concierge call - L/M', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2016-04-29 14:21:16', '2016-04-29 14:21:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002581029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746004', 'Jared Schaffer', NULL, '4-29-16 Jessica called to understand how to handle doctor visits, submit bills for reimbursement, etc. She has a few bills for family from pink eye infection, ear infections and a well baby visit. She has the medical expense form to fill out and submit with bills. I also gave her Concierge phone # to call in the future.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-04-29 13:00:45', '2016-04-29 13:00:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002581025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002263007', 'Laura Sedivy', NULL, '4-29-16 Laura just told me Joshua just learned that he''s covered through the VA and he needs to be eliminated from this application now. So, only Laura needs a plan and she might be getting a job very soon with benefits. UGH!!!  She wants to stick with regular insurance and not health sharing.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-04-29 12:47:27', '2016-04-29 12:47:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002581017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167701', 'Mike Bird', NULL, '4-29-16 Sherrie Supervisor helped to fix income to reflect $44,500! New APTC is $931.10 and Premium is $418.59 for May 1st! Total plan cost is still $1349.69. ALL SET!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-04-29 12:32:19', '2016-04-29 12:32:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002581013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002263007', 'Laura Sedivy', NULL, '4-29-16 Sherrie Supervisor helping to fix their income as well. Still only showing Joshua''s income but it''s correct because Child Support does NOT count as income!!!!!!!!  They actually get the high APTC that the system is reflecting. Wahoo!  We can pick a plan now because everything is accurate and the continue button is showing. If the system defaults to June 1st we have to call in after we submit the plan selection to have it changed to May 1st. We are all set and Sherrie closed the ticket for us.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-04-29 12:27:55', '2016-04-29 12:40:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002581007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001107434', 'Lauren Peterson', NULL, '4-29-16 Sherrie- Supervisor checking on Lauren''s account to make sure her deductible will carry over. Same SSAP. She''s changing her address in the system. Lauren''s plan was not yet sent to carrier. Old address 10 South View something.. Boulder, CO 80305.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-04-29 12:20:16', '2016-04-29 12:22:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002581003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167701', 'Mike Bird', NULL, '4-29-16 Mike got a vm from Eddie at C4HCO to call. He called and talked with Sierra who made a bigger mess of his account and wants Debbie''s ledger uploaded into his documents.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-04-29 11:17:53', '2016-04-29 11:17:53'),
