  ('zcrm_1579374000002561019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002263007', 'Laura Sedivy', NULL, '4-28-16 Steve with C4HCO is looking at her account. He is NOT bright. Case # 1BBG4Q4, Auth. # 423854493.... nothing changed. He updated ticket saying we are waiting for response. So annoying!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-04-28 11:12:09', '2016-04-28 11:36:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002561015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001107434', 'Lauren Peterson', NULL, '4-28-16 Lauren needed change of address which I did for her through Peak. We just verified through Deana at Kaiser that since she won''t have a lapse in coverage she will be eligible for a cross over credit which will keep her current deductibles intact since she already met the ded for the year. If she doesn''t see the cross over carried over onto her new account she will need to request it via Cust Svc # on the back of her card.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-04-28 10:50:34', '2016-04-28 10:50:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002561011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167691', 'Catherine Dailey', NULL, '4-28-16 Cat also visit the ER for bronchitis in March and she''s panicked about the cost of that bill and they did absolutely nothing for her. Was a waste and she will never do that again. It was a bad experience. Went to BCH.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-04-28 10:31:44', '2016-04-28 10:31:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002561007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167691', 'Catherine Dailey', NULL, '4-28-16 Message to John Kach from Me-
You will be getting a call from my client Cat Dailey who just received a bill from Boulder Community Health for $2000 from lab work that was done back in October of 2015. She''s panicked but I eased her mind. She will be calling you to discuss all of the details. She needs help to submit cost of a medication from an ER visit as well. She''s super nice but we need to get this squared away since she''s getting this huge bill from BCH now.  She''ll probably call tomorrow morning.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-04-28 10:30:46', '2016-04-28 10:30:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002561003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746002', 'Ross Scatchard', NULL, '4-28-16 Spoke with Riley at LHS and changed Ross'' plan to the Liberty Share Plan and she quoted him a $149 monthly share amount (not sure why it''s not $157, but wasn''t going to argue). This will be applied towards May''s monthly share amount. He''s happy and all set now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-04-28 10:23:14', '2016-04-28 10:23:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002550003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001413013', 'Aaron Weiner', NULL, '4-27-16 Randy checked and his payment was made with LHS successfully for April, 2016. So, everything is current and up to date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-04-27 14:22:01', '2016-04-27 14:22:01'),
