Sharebox password: healthy1', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2016-04-26 13:04:35', '2016-06-15 16:29:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002524022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165413', 'Irene (Renee) Barbeau', NULL, '4-26-16 Told her the procedure to handle Balance Bill she''s receiving from Boulder Community Hospital. Also shared with her that she can have LHS and regular ins. But, LHS will be considered her secondary insurance and regular insurance as primary. Doesn''t really seem to make sense since ins. will have super high deductible to meet first.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-04-26 11:48:08', '2016-04-26 11:48:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002524018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167701', 'Mike Bird', NULL, 'Tkt # 160 426-329 993 Shasta with C4HCO to correct Mike''s income to reflect $44,500. Was showing at $33K incorrectly! May take 10 days to 2 weeks for fix to occur. Mike will receive an email from C4HCO when tix has been worked.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-04-26 11:09:40', '2016-04-26 11:09:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002524014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002024005', 'Kenneth Korr', NULL, '03.28.16:  Recvd. HES email - approved from LHS.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-04-26 08:17:28', '2016-04-26 08:17:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002523043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001413013', 'Aaron Weiner', NULL, '4-25-16 Updated Randy''s cc information with the PDF Invoice to reflect new card ending in 2889. Instructed him to call LHS to update cc with them. All set with us. I''ll email him confirmation. Transaction Number: 8349526046, Invoice Number: NOTE-001452, Amount Paid: USD $50.00.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-04-25 17:33:32', '2016-04-25 17:33:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000002523019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001634097', 'Dale Kurtz', NULL, '4-25-16 Updated CC with LHS and HES. Spoke with Kevin at LHS with Dale on the line to update cc and mail new Careington cards as well as email Medical Reimbursement forms. All set for now. Dale tried to get pre-approval', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-04-25 16:08:31', '2016-04-25 16:08:31'),
