  ('zcrm_1579374000001949003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000168048', 'Lornette Browne', NULL, '-------- Original Message --------
Subject: Colonoscopy
From: "Lornette Browne" <lornette@randygage.com>
Date: Thu, February 25, 2016 11:34 am
To: <glowe@myafe.org>

Hello Gary,
 
Eileen from Liberty just called me.  She said Aventura Surgery Center
is definitely not going to accept Liberty.  I will HAVE to self-pay then they
will provide me with the paperwork to get reimbursed.  Eileen said she
could try to see if Memorial would accept Liberty.  I have come so
far to this point so I’m not prepared to go through that again.  I will
get the C done with the doctor I signed up with and self-pay with my
Citicard and get reimbursed later.
 
Thanks for your efforts in this.
 
Have a great weekend and we’ll catch up later.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2016-02-25 10:12:57', '2016-02-25 10:12:57'),
