  ('zcrm_1579374000001935005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746011', 'Laura Seraydarian', NULL, '2-23-16 C4HCO Kevin sees last update on tax info. was 2-15-16 when information sent to another department and ticket closed on their end. It''s still not updated. Once it is fixed it will still take up to 2 weeks to be sent in the mail to client. Easily may take a few more weeks! Might want to get tax extension.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-02-23 16:08:27', '2016-02-23 16:08:27'),
