  ('zcrm_1579374000001865029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165363', 'Adrian Denise Farley', NULL, '2-17-16 Applied for Anthem Dental Ins. today for a 3/1/16 start date and about $25 a month.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-02-17 12:01:00', '2016-02-17 12:01:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001865011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689078', 'Kim Gangwish Zahorik', NULL, '2-17-16 Needing to switch plan to Anthem Silver X PPO 3200/25 for about $291 a month bc Dr. Drigan Wieder only accepts Anthem PPO not HMOs. Asking Ann Eisenhart if we can change it asap. She hasn''t effectuated her plan yet bc was gone for a funeral when Anthem''s packet came in last week.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-02-17 11:51:46', '2016-02-17 11:51:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001865003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165372', 'Jennifer Norden (formerly Fuentes)', NULL, '2-17-16 We set her up with auto-pay for her Feb and beyond payments with Anthem. Username is jennifernorden and pwd is nitrodog3. Full payment is $386.86.  Paid $385.06 and owes $1.80 which she will send in with a check.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-02-17 10:14:56', '2016-02-17 10:17:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001854003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001709173', 'Leslie McDougall', NULL, '2/16/16 Leslie emailed me that she will sign up in March for April start.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-16 17:44:51', '2016-02-16 17:44:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001846031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001763111', 'Dawn Costello', NULL, '02.16.16:  Dawn called me & said LHS approved them for Liberty HealthTrac provisional program.  told her to call # for provisional team and find out specifics.  Called LHS for Dawn. Found out that to get couple price you must be married.  Each of her sons, when Matthew is 20, will have to enroll as individuals w/$50 discount each.  Called Dawn - left message w/info. for her.
Dawn emailed. Heard back from LHS. Husband must be in program at least 90 days. Dawn is sending Robin''s results from his recent check-up. LHS nurse will evaluate and make a decision. Emailed her to keep me posted.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-16 10:07:12', '2016-02-17 06:21:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001846027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001763111', 'Dawn Costello', NULL, '02.16.16:  Emailed Dawn.  Will contact her provider.  Will discuss affiliate participation after she is approved and her account is set up.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-16 08:00:04', '2016-02-16 08:00:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001846013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001763111', 'Dawn Costello', NULL, '02.15.16:  Dawn called. Enrolled her and her family.  Wants to be an Affiliate. Discussed briefly.  Wants to start a team in Orlando. Emailed me her provider''s website.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-16 07:32:42', '2016-02-16 07:33:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001846005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '02.15.16:  Enrolled Jessica. Discussed affiliate participation. Sent her new member flyer &amp; rack card for her and Jennifer. She will discuss HES w/Jennifer. Wants to meet in Sonoma.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-16 07:27:40', '2016-02-16 07:27:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001840017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000382653', 'Katherine Marie Curtis', NULL, 'Invitation to WellFit sent', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2016-02-15 16:32:12', '2016-02-15 16:32:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001839005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '02.14.16:  Jessica Called. Discussed HES - loves the program.  Wants to enroll &amp; be an affiliate. Said her partner, Jennifer will as well.  Scheduled appt. to enroll her tomorrow.  Jennifer''s brother''s name is Jeff Campbell, a massage therapist to whom I gave my member flyer.  Also, Jessica has a chiropractor and nutritionist who she''d like to bring on board as A.P.s.  Said her mother would enroll as well.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-15 08:18:50', '2016-02-15 08:27:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001835047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '02.13.16:  Called Jessica - l/m to c/b. Texted her to suggest she let me know a best time to talk w/her.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-13 12:10:56', '2016-02-13 12:42:53'),
