Realtor for Allison James Estates &amp; Homes, 2888 Laker Ave., Carlsbad, CA 92010.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-13 12:09:28', '2016-02-15 08:12:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001835011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001763111', 'Dawn Costello', NULL, '02.13.16:  Called - l/m to c/b.  Suggested she give me a time when she would be available to talk.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-13 11:37:06', '2016-02-13 12:43:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001835007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001763111', 'Dawn Costello', NULL, '02.12.16:  Missed Dawn''s call. Called - l/m to c/b. Dawn registered for our HES intro. webinar but did not attend.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-13 11:35:04', '2016-02-13 12:44:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001820013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165409', 'Bruce Zuccaro', NULL, '2/12/16 crm - client called in wanted to cancel - told i couldn''t do that for them - only wendy could, he to call wendy, then i proceeded to explain why he shouldn''t cancel.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2016-02-12 08:05:25', '2016-02-12 08:05:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001810047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001106363', 'Samantha Klinkner', NULL, '2-11-16 Malisa with C4HCO Tkt # 160211-244694 to resubmit plan to remain active with Anthem. Anthem has 7-10 business days to process. C4 sends info over twice a week.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-02-11 16:08:39', '2016-02-11 16:08:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001813020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165403', 'Stephanie Soibelman', NULL, '2-11-16 Frustrated because getting nasty calls and bills from her doctor''s office because her annual physical has not been paid by LHS. Some of it was finally paid for but not all of it. It might have been coded wrong. Also some of the blood tests run may not be customary and included in a regular wellness checkup.  She''s going to call doctor''s office and LHS one more time to get more clarity. Realizes she might need to pay for part of it. This wasn''t as easy as she was hoping and expecting. She''ll call me back if she has any more troubles.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-02-11 15:07:13', '2016-02-11 15:07:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001812011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001763111', 'Dawn Costello', NULL, '02.11.16:  Jacque recvd. email from Dawn - wants to enroll. Called, l/m that I would be happy to help her enroll - to call me.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-11 11:21:25', '2016-02-13 12:44:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001812005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001757125', 'Brenda Lee Gibson', NULL, '02.10.16:  Recvd. very nice email from Lee.  She enrolled herself in HES on 2.9.16 and was approved.  Thanked me for helping her and said she''d tell her friends &amp; family about HES.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-11 11:03:11', '2016-02-11 11:03:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001800035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746011', 'Laura Seraydarian', NULL, '2-10-16 C4HCO Chris is sending out another Tax form to Laura but it''s showing the wrong amount. It''s not including the months when she had an APTC of $199. Maria is checking on tax credit now and there''s already an open ticket from Laura calling in earlier today.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-02-10 15:50:50', '2016-02-10 15:50:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001799037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001799013', 'Ray Iglesias', NULL, '2/10/16 invited to meet with Paul Cholak Joan and I on 2/16 to sign up', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-10 11:49:40', '2018-05-29 07:59:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001799033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001799013', 'Ray Iglesias', NULL, '2/5/16 Ray is an insurance agent.  Interested in our product after the 15th of the month.  Wants to learn more about being an agent affiliate', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-10 11:49:10', '2016-02-10 11:49:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001799007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001757185', 'Rey Perez', NULL, '2/17/16 emailing myahe.org/wwg info', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-10 11:33:54', '2016-03-02 13:34:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001786011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001166015', 'Ashley Ageloff', NULL, '02.09.16:  Called Ashley. Told her to fill out and sign the LHS agreement. Then I will draft her HES APA agreement for her to sign.  Also I will find out who she should speak to about reimbursement rate for her services.  She said she can''t wait for reimbursement as she has to pay her doctors for reading the thermography images.  I told her she could collect the money up front and have her client submit it to LHS for reimbursement. She preferred that approach.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-09 16:52:37', '2016-02-09 16:52:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001786007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001166015', 'Ashley Ageloff', NULL, '02.04.16:  Ashley called.  She is very interested in being an AP. Told her I would discuss it w/her when I returned from the Health Expo this weekend.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-09 16:49:39', '2016-02-09 16:49:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001786003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001166015', 'Ashley Ageloff', NULL, '01.06.16:  Emailed Ashley AP Decision Guide &amp; Agreement and notified her that Thermography is accepted in the LHS Guidelines. Also I have clients for her. Found out Ashley is in Australia w/her boyfriend at his family home.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-09 16:48:25', '2016-02-09 16:48:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001784005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165323', 'Kevin Schill', NULL, '2-9-16 Kevin got generic prescription now from doc for his daughter since Doryx was about $150 for 1 month and his x-wife found the new prescription for $45 instead from some online option. He''s not impressed by the HES meds options thus far. So, I''m asking for the new prescription to see if I can help further or not.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-02-09 15:54:33', '2016-02-09 15:54:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001764011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001674019', 'Danielle Sheridan', NULL, '2-8-16 Jakaylian with C4HCO changed Danielle''s address and updated it on application and Peak. Carrier will be sent newest address information. Payment due date is the 25th of month preceding start date, ie. Feb. 25th.  Danielle also wants dental plan which I will send Humana and is also willing to add me as her BF''s BOR if I sent her instructions of how to do so again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-02-08 15:18:46', '2016-02-08 15:18:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001759269', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001759243', 'Karen Ehrbar', NULL, '2/8/16 Sent Karen info about HES, needs insurance - is on cobra now.  Getting a job so she can get insurance', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-08 14:42:20', '2016-02-08 14:42:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001763253', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001898011', 'Amanda Wamunyima', NULL, '02.07.16:  Discussed HES - interested. Send webinar info.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-08 14:04:49', '2016-02-08 14:04:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001764003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001194079', 'Janet Streater', NULL, '2-8-16 She was uncomfortable about the notes the say This Is Not Insurance and panicked and cancelled with LHS for 1/31/16. She signed up with an ACA plan on her own. Now understands I can help her with all aspects of health care coverage.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-02-08 14:02:45', '2016-02-08 14:02:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001763241', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001763219', 'Anthony Smith', NULL, '02.07.16:  Just signed up for Obamacare (Humana). Having a lot of trouble w/process (marketplace has different info. than Humana). Spend 20 hrs trying to fix it - fed up! Discussed HES - very interested. Send webinar invite.  HOT!', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-08 14:01:49', '2016-02-08 14:01:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001763209', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001763187', 'Kathrine Devlin', NULL, '02.07.16:  Currently do not have health insurance - interested in HES. Send webinar invite. - very warm. Has female spouse.  (just got married) Wants HES for couple.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2016-02-08 13:54:11', '2016-02-08 13:54:11'),
