  ('zcrm_1579374000001572011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689078', 'Kim Gangwish Zahorik', NULL, '1-20-16 Tatiana and I completed process for enrollment- 88921203. $227.94 pmt amt and APTC$638.22. Tatiana''s # 719-375-2678. Now going to escalate it with Anthem since medical emergency. May be 24 hours or more. Not sure.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-01-20 14:08:23', '2016-01-20 14:08:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001572007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165362', 'David Blair', NULL, '1-20-16 Janet with Anthem said Dave''s account was slated to be cancelled for 2/1/16 which is NOT what we want. Called C4HCO and they say there is no indication of asking for cancellation. But, willing to submit message to Anthem to keep plan effective. They think bc they start date was changed to 1/1/16 that Anthem will have to reinstate plan which is why it''s showing the cancellation. That information was sent on 1/14/16. Should be fixed in a few days. Spoke with Shandra first and was hung on on. She was grumpy. Then spoke with Amber who both told me same thing. Amber gave me Tkt # 160120-196011.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-01-20 12:49:27', '2016-01-20 12:49:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001569003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689078', 'Kim Gangwish Zahorik', NULL, '1-20-16 Matt Wiik with C4HCO called me to let me know the APTC is now fixed to $585.96 and they "should" be able to select the chosen plan for us now. Jennifer trying to help us now. Still all messed up!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-01-20 09:30:36', '2016-01-20 09:52:41'),
