  ('zcrm_1579374000001555119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001196081', 'Kate Hamilton', NULL, '1-19-16 C4HCO sent enrollment info to Anthem on 1/7/16 for a 1/1/16 start date. One area was showing a 2/1/16 start date. Submitting a ticket to make sure it''s correct.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-01-19 14:30:20', '2016-01-19 14:30:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001555107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165428', 'Sharon Valentine', NULL, '1-19-16 Case ID #1B7VTS0 , Auth #412508203. But, APTC was wrong bc showing old income of $24K not the accurate $67,200. Therefore both kids are NOT eligible for Medicaid. So, they need to keep HES plan with 2 kids and husband William on new Anthem plan that we choose to keep his doctors. Steve from C4HCO working with me now to fix account properly. Corrected Tracking #Auth #412512587. Corrected APTC is $117.31. Makes much more sense.  Tkt # 160119-193902. That is only if we include both kids. Now they don''t qualify at all for any APTC bc only 1 person needing coverage. Chose the cheapest Anthem Bronze Pathway X HMO plan with a 2/1/16 start date. It shows as 3/1/16 but will be fixed in a few days.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-01-19 14:02:14', '2016-01-19 14:24:28'),
