  ('zcrm_1579374000001538079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001214115', 'Kenneth Davidson', NULL, '1-15-16 Left vm for Kenneth to tell him why application came back as it did, rejected for one family member.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-01-15 12:00:34', '2016-01-15 12:00:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001538069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001363007', 'Kimberly Donars', NULL, '1-15-16 Kimberly is going to talk with PT, Clay to see if anything on records to indicate any sort of relevant issue in shoulder since LHS Cust. Svc. Rep instilled fear in her that her recent accident of fainting and falling and injuring shoulder could be anything but an accident.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-01-15 11:53:11', '2016-01-15 11:53:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001538065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001424005', 'Christine (Lindsay) Wheeler', NULL, '1-15-16 Spoke with Kevin at LHS. They had sent Lindsey an email regarding her provisional membership bc of her recent smoking habit. Told Lindsey to speak with Sue Rohr about it. Will await her response.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2016-01-15 11:25:37', '2016-01-15 11:25:37'),
