  ('zcrm_1579374000001520033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165313', 'Denice Sparks', NULL, 'Andrea with Exec Resolution Team called me to help with Denice''s case- 719-375-2813. I called back 1-13-16 and left vm. Matt Wiik Service Manager with C4HCO is also helping push it through.  
