  ('zcrm_1579374000001107581', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000840013', 'Shayla Carson', NULL, 'Transferred info. from Prospects page- They are all set with decision. Ready to enroll once sites are working. Choosing Molina Healthcare of Utah Silver HMO at $57 a month after APTC with her income at $20K. Ded. $450 and MOP $2250. UPDATE- She said $20K but then said $1200 a month to equal $14400. Put $1500 a month to equal $18K as best guess.  She does not claim her daughter on her taxes this year. Her daughter is in custody of the state. Daughter Alivvya has disabilities, seizures, brain development problems, etc.

Enrollment all complete for 2016.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-12-03 16:24:05', '2015-12-03 16:24:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001107549', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165337', 'Steven ONeal', NULL, '12-3-15 Spoke w/ Steven and last day of current job is tomorrow. He''s going to go ahead and apply for Medicaid until he gets a new job. Once he gets a new job, if it doesn''t include health ins. he will follow up with me to enroll in HES. But, I will need to explain it to him at that time. Cheapest Marketplace plan is $384 with Bronze Kaiser which is terrible. ALL SET for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-12-03 16:10:23', '2015-12-03 16:10:34'),
