  ('zcrm_1579374000001060109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001065005', 'Jianny Adamo', NULL, '11.24.15:  Called Jianny.  Discussed HES. She has a weakend back and goes to chiropractor 10 - 12x/yr. Pays out-of-pocket. Told her that may be treated as a pre-existing condition and would not be included in her share amount, however, all else will.  .  I suggested she apply to find out how LHS would treat her issue. She also asked about mental therapy (more in terms of her own professional needs).  I told her LHS might use her as a health coach for emotional issues (stress, anxiety).  I will research this w/LHS. I asked Jianny to create a list of her menu of services so I can present it to LHS when I talk to them about her.
I told Jianny to calculate her out-of-pocket cost yearly for chiropractic therapy to see if insurance or health sharing would work better for her needs.  She says she spends anywhere from $30 - $75 for a visit, depending on the service.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2015-11-24 18:27:00', '2015-11-24 18:29:29'),
