  ('zcrm_1579374000001042048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000990086', 'Domenic Pompile, P.T.', NULL, '11.20.15:  Met Julie Berk, physical therapist at Vado. She recognized me from Women of Excellence group. Interested in Affiiiate opportunity.  *Schedule mtg. to discuss.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2015-11-22 10:03:45', '2015-11-22 10:03:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001042040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000822081', 'Else Engel', NULL, '11.20.15:  Briefly discussed Affiliate position for Else.  She is interested. She is a mktg/Provider liaison and has network of prospects.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2015-11-22 09:50:58', '2015-11-22 09:50:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001042031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001042005', 'Debbie Berke', NULL, '11.22.15:  Emailed Debbie Berke HES flyer and web link.  Calculated her HES yearly costs &amp; told her to compare them w/her health ins. yearly costs. Asked her to contact me when she has done so &amp; reviewed HES materials.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2015-11-22 09:44:40', '2015-11-22 09:44:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001042025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001042005', 'Debbie Berke', NULL, '11.20.15:  Marie at Vado Therapy introduced me to another pt. at the office. Debbie Berke - 561-542-2405; dhb825@aol.com.  Interested in HES.  Is generally healthy but has possible back issue, so goes to physical therapy 2x/wk. preventatively.  Her doctor told her if she doesn''t, she may need back sx.  Debbie is paying out of pocket for physical therapy as well as for her insurance.  Told Debbie she should calculate what it''s costing her per year for P.T. & insurance and compare it to what she would pay for HES and out-of-pocket for P.T.  She wants HES info.  Told her I would email it.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2015-11-22 07:31:02', '2015-11-22 07:32:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001041023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000822081', 'Else Engel', NULL, '11.20.15:  Ran in to Else at Panero''s during lunch.  She is interested in taking HES for herself and her husband but she wants to be sure her doctors will accept it.  Check out her docs.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2015-11-21 17:07:38', '2015-11-21 17:07:38'),
