  ('zcrm_1579374000001006184', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001006188', 'Sean Walton', NULL, '11-19-15 Talked with him for a second and was super nice and then got cut off or hung up on. Not sure. So, called back twice and giving up. Think he doesn''t want help perhaps. Has back problems and makes doctor visits one a month at $100 each. Meds are $27 each month.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-11-19 16:55:49', '2015-11-19 16:55:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000001006160', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001006162', 'Nancy Bebo', NULL, 'Interested to learn.  Had coverage this summer but was retiring soon and will be 63 when retires. Might need help then.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-11-19 16:47:09', '2015-11-19 16:47:09'),
