  ('zcrm_1579374000000940013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000906021', 'Judy Glueck', NULL, '10.19.15:  Rcvd. bus. card at Biz to Biz Expo.
11.03.15:  Judy called HES 800#. Wendy got call & notified me. Emailed Judy to ask when we could speak.
11.04.15:  Judy emailed. Is researching health ins. plans through the Marketplace. Asked if we do individual as well as group coverage.
11.05.15:  Emailed Judy - said we have ins. agents who could help her choose between ins. & health sharing. Asked if we could schedule call to speak. Mentioned HES webinar explaining ACA, ins., & sharing.
11.06.15:  Called Judy. Briefly explained program. She is sending a list of her employees - needs quote on rates. Said she is also interested in HES for herself.  I emailed her HES webinar dates and invite.
11.09.15:  Recvd. email from Judy - thanked me for webinar invite.
11.10.15:  Emailed Judy. Said I did not as yet receive her staff list. Suggested she have her agent give her their quote, then let us see if HES would be a fit for the staff.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2015-11-11 13:48:48', '2015-11-11 13:48:48'),
