  ('zcrm_1579374000000824033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, '10-30-15 All set to keep HES. Chris was just added and had reached her $500 but now bumped up to $1000. Asked her for names of docs she hasn''t seen yet to alleviate the effort of submitting the bills herself. All set for 2016!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-10-30 17:08:08', '2015-10-30 17:08:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000824029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165383', 'Tyler McMahon', NULL, '10-30-15 Will stick with HES. Curious why CO Health Op out of biz bc was interested in them. Slightly concerned that clinic in Nepal won''t submit bill to LHS. Told him if so, then he''d have to submit it for reimbursement. Can''t force them to submit it. All set for now!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-10-30 16:22:08', '2015-10-30 16:22:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000824025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167691', 'Catherine Dailey', NULL, '10-30-15 Cat is happy with HES and keeping it.  She asked about how to make use of naturopathic services so I explained. She''s sending me a referral as well. Asked her to send doctors name so no confusion when she goes in for her annual obgyn appointment soon and gets lab work done.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-10-30 15:56:58', '2015-10-30 15:56:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000824015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191497', 'Michael Rust', NULL, '10-30-15 Micki says Michael is extremely happy with HES.  She''s happy about the Naturopathic inclusion and wishes you didn''t need a diagnosis.  Told her naturopath can diagnose and also provide annual physical. All set moving forward into 2016!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-10-30 14:00:15', '2015-10-30 14:00:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000824011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165391', 'Patricia Piper', NULL, '10/30/15 They are on vacation now and arriving back Nov. 20th. They''ve paid for all their expenses thus far but was wondering about colonoscopies.  I sent her the info. from the guidelines about sharing for that. We''ll talk upon return.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-10-30 13:54:20', '2015-10-30 13:54:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000824007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165335', 'Glen Delman', NULL, '10-30-15 Glen and Melody are happy with their HES and want to keep it moving forward.  Pleased especially since CO Health Op is done.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-10-30 13:10:05', '2015-10-30 13:10:05'),
