  ('zcrm_1579374000000733010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000162494', 'Linda Stahr', NULL, 'Contacted Linda she was unable to talk to me due to death in family.  Told me she had alot of issues with her plan this year.  Also interested in a good Dental option.  Set appt with her to go over options for 11/5 @10am', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2015-10-22 09:26:05', '2015-10-22 09:26:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000720008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191478', 'Hope Gainer', NULL, 'She emailed me to see if Liberty shared in Dental and Vision and about RX issues. I called and emailed her the Carrington link. Told her to call me with any Questions.', 'Advanced Consulting', 'Advanced Consulting', '2015-10-22 08:09:27', '2016-04-22 11:31:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000726003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689078', 'Kim Gangwish Zahorik', NULL, '10/21/15 Ideally wants a plan that she can keep year to year without dealing with all the changes.  BUT, can get a sizable subsidy so makes most sense for now to complete the Medicaid application now that husband has released him from Medicaid system. She''s going to login today to see if she can move forward. Knows CO Health Op is done and wants to know other options in Marketplace.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-10-21 09:33:00', '2015-12-07 13:53:07'),
