•PT Back - Karen Fisher (Boulder Center for Sports Medicine)
•Psychologist - Sonja Hellman (Independent practice)
•Dental - Susan Takemoto (NO Insurance)
•Eye - Richard A. Cross (Boulder Vision Associates - NO Insurance)', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-10-19 16:40:53', '2015-10-19 16:40:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000706003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000162465', 'Deborah (Debi) Wist', NULL, 'Debi contacted me today and told me that she had received her renewal notice.  I asked if price went up she said she did not think so.  She said that her income info had not changed but was interested in looking at UHC options.  I advised her to contact me 11/15 to look at those options.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2015-10-19 15:43:57', '2015-10-19 15:43:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000703031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165402', 'Stephen Carl Price', NULL, '10/19/15 Stephen wants to stick with CO Health Op if something reverses and they remain in biz.  Not sure if that''s possible. Otherwise, he wants to explore options. His back is pretty much better.  Has annual check-ups for heart / cardiology bc of family history of problems.  But, currently no issues and no meds for heart. Leaving town Nov. 2-20th and will be on boat but checking in here and there with email when on land. Nov. 20th - Dec. 11 no set schedule yet. Dec. 11th flying to San Juan and will likely be more readily available after that point. Trusting me to find best options to share with him to make decision.  Open to HES but wants to see options first of course.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-10-19 14:51:12', '2015-10-19 14:51:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000701046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000168031', 'Karen Weir', NULL, 'Followed up ith Diana......Case (Dr. Abitbol) Assigned to Amy Ammon.  She has worked with Ms. Weir before…..', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2015-10-19 09:39:26', '2015-10-19 09:39:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000701042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000168048', 'Lornette Browne', NULL, 'Spoke to Lornette, Asked that she call Neustater''s office and have them call diana..... gave her contact info.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2015-10-19 09:36:47', '2015-10-19 09:36:47'),
