  ('zcrm_1579374000000641017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165362', 'David Blair', NULL, '10/9/15- Got note that CO Health Op Bighorn Multi-State Plan is ending but the equivalent Bighorn Plan should be equally as good. He''ll want to stick with it.  But, we need to check pricing once available.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-10-09 10:02:12', '2015-10-09 10:02:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000641011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, '10/9/15 Spoke with Chris and he''s going to have Kimberly call into LHS to add him to the membership for an 11/1/15 start date and will cancel his Anthem plan and Adventure Advocates accident plan policy. He''s THRILLED!!!!!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-10-09 09:54:48', '2015-10-09 09:54:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000637003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000168048', 'Lornette Browne', NULL, 'Contacted Diana Kettlewell explained situation.  Routine colonoscopy gave doctors contact info. Said she''d contact them today..... told Lornette I''d keep her posted.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2015-10-08 14:52:01', '2015-10-08 14:52:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000630027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, '10/7/15 Chris Baldwin needs coverage as well starting on Jan. 1st. We can just add him to her account mid Dec. for Jan. 1st start date.  Left him a vm today.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-10-07 16:41:32', '2015-10-07 16:41:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000630013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165429', 'Jodie Brenner', NULL, 'About 10/2/15 she was concerned about paying the extra $50 to MPB. Didn''t understand the value and was frustrated bc the Careington card didn''t cover her dentist. Canyon Chiropractic also wouldn''t honor it even though supposedly on the provider list. She''s already paying their lowest price at $40. She now understands she''s paying for the support with all of the benefits she has to complete her package.  She should be on the top of the list for concierge help!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-10-07 16:21:15', '2015-10-07 16:21:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000601003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000162563', 'Alicia Ellis', NULL, 'Called Healthcare.gov with Alicia and straightened her issue out.  She still has to send proof of income which she will do via her account.  She will call when she gets her renewal and will also go over dental options.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2015-09-30 14:09:21', '2015-09-30 14:09:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000589007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000162563', 'Alicia Ellis', NULL, 'Alicia called and let me know that she had been notified that the Marketplace had not received her proof of income.  She then contacted the Mktplc and was told that she would have to go through app process again.  I will call with her to find out what we can do.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2015-09-25 12:14:07', '2015-09-25 12:14:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000588046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000518266', 'Daniela Dadurian, M.D.', NULL, '09.03.15:  Daniela called.  Wants to enroll in HES.  Told her I''m in Virginia, will return on the 9th.  Will call to schedule appt. to enroll her at her office.

09.09.15:  Called. Daniela.  Scheduled meeting to enroll in HES.

09.14.15:  Met w/Daniela at her W.P.B. office.  Enrolled her in HES.  She also signed Accepting Provider Agreement.  Told her to let me know when LHS notifies her of her enrollment status.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2015-09-25 09:11:29', '2015-09-25 09:11:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000551025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000551005', 'Oswaldo Zarraga-Garcia', NULL, 'Estimated eligibility results

This household may be eligible for a $191.65 per month premium tax credit to lower monthly premium costs.

This household may also be eligible for cost-sharing reductions that reduce what you pay for deductibles, copayments, and coinsurance. These cost-sharing savings apply only to Silver plans.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2015-09-17 13:28:47', '2015-09-17 13:28:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000547003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165422', 'Jen Durkin', NULL, '9-16-15 WS- Spoke with Jen and scheduled to talk 9-24-15 at 11:00 am. Jen''s on maternity leave ''til next week.  Just had baby girl but delivery was late. 4 weeks old now. Jen''s company just doubled employees to 8 full time now.  May want a Nov., Dec. or Jan. 1st start date depending on how it all looks.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-09-16 15:19:13', '2015-09-16 15:19:13'),
