  ('zcrm_1579374000000461028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165416', 'Tamara Kerner', NULL, 'Careington Discount card will be resent. Submission to do so has been made already through Michelle at LHS. Bin #009893, PCN #ROIRX, ID # LHS902745, Group # LHS01. Also Michelle is emailing Tamara. Gave info to Kelsey at Pharmaca but she won''t page Tamara to let her know it''s all set. Once Tamara comes back to counter she can.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-09-08 14:59:24', '2015-09-08 14:59:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000461011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165400', 'Ross Metler', NULL, '9-8-15 Spoke with Tim Salaz at Broker Line 844-417-9000 and he noted everything and contacted Billing Dept. to ask about cancellation of plan for 7-31-15. They said to disregard the bill as there will be no negative consequences. Got cut off from Tim and called 866-915-6619 x-4281 and spoke with Emily. She said they rec''d FAX showing proof of other coverage. Fax rec''d on 8/12/15.  Again no negative repercussions for not paying bill. Will continue to work on dating the cancellation for 7/31/15. All is well and good.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-09-08 10:31:54', '2015-09-08 10:31:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000461003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165400', 'Ross Metler', NULL, '8-3-15 Spoke with Delilah and Vic at CO Health Op to cancel Ross'' plan as of 7/31/15 because he has other coverage HES starting 8/1/15. Just need to send CO Health Op proof of coverage. Fax to 610-374-6986 Attn.: Delilah R. Incident # 150803-000595. Ref. # for CO Health Op- 8936687 with Delilah. It''s set to cancel back to 7/31/15 and cancelled auto-pay.  Sent FAX with proof of LHS plan on 8/12/15 through OneBox.com.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-09-08 10:17:54', '2015-09-08 10:28:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000411191', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000278011', 'Abraham Raba - Galarza', NULL, 'Added Abraham to Stan''s insurance but chose different CO Health Op Plan than Stan has. No subsidy required.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-09-02 11:44:02', '2015-09-02 11:44:02'),
