  ('zcrm_1579374000000278055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000278043', 'Marie Bone', NULL, 'Sent her the enrollment link for her to complete while she waits to hear back from docs about possibly cheaper options for the Divigel. Still less expensive than any alternatives with regular insurance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-08-18 16:09:07', '2015-08-18 16:09:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000278035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746011', 'Laura Seraydarian', NULL, '8/18/15- Wayman with C4HCO updating Laura''s CO Health Op Silver Bison Plan to no longer receive subsidy as of 9/1/15 bc of new income at $75 an our for Boulder contract. Uploaded proof of contract into C4HCO account. Incident # 150818-001370. Uploaded into the CO Health Op system within 7-10 business days. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-08-18 15:55:52', '2015-08-18 15:58:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000000278025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746011', 'Laura Seraydarian', NULL, 'Updating her income to above subsidy level. $75 an hour. $75,000 annually showing on contract but not necessarily accurate. She''s choosing between keeping her CO Health Op plan or switching to HES.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2015-08-18 14:53:32', '2015-08-18 14:53:32'),
